(2305533, 318774, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the choice to go b/w. The lines also play well however I''m not digging the crop and angle you took. Also, there isn''t enough wow factor. What I find most interesting and not because I''m a guy :) is that each one shows their lower backs. Sorta reminds me of a tv commercial that had animated belly buttons singing a jingle.</td>', 'I like the choice to go b/w. The lines also play well however I''m not digging the crop and angle you took. Also, there isn''t enough wow factor. What I find most interesting and not because I''m a guy :) is that each one shows their lower backs. Sorta reminds me of a tv commercial that had animated belly buttons singing a jingle.', '2006-04-12 02:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305544, 319875, 41337, '<td valign="top">This should do well. The colors are great. The blues and browns look really nice. Also, I like how the blonde hair lines up with the white text and the grey boots with the grey pavement. That alignment really cements the person into the image which plays well with the "hangin''" around theme. Gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'This should do well. The colors are great. The blues and browns look really nice. Also, I like how the blonde hair lines up with the white text and the grey boots with the grey pavement. That alignment really cements the person into the image which plays well with the "hangin''" around theme. Gets a 9 from me.', '2006-04-12 03:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
