(2305642, 319695, 48524, '<td valign="top">Subject looks a littl too posed and ready for a candid shot, in my opinion.  And also, making use of the full 640px dimension would increase your score.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, it''s a nice shot...the flowers at varying distances add interest, and you captured a sweet moment.  <br/> <br/>I''m not voting this challenge, so good luck.  You''ll probably lose a few points on the filesize...</td>', 'Subject looks a littl too posed and ready for a candid shot, in my opinion.  And also, making use of the full 640px dimension would increase your score. Otherwise, it''s a nice shot...the flowers at varying distances add interest, and you captured a sweet moment.   I''m not voting this challenge, so good luck.  You''ll probably lose a few points on the filesize...', '2006-04-12 04:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305648, 318381, 48524, '<td valign="top">Personally, I feel that borders other than black or white are very distracting...especially since the color kind of matches the grass, and it''s a little awkward-looking.  Otherwise, I really love this shot...you''ve captured a really nice moment, the strength of the wind is very evident and the very shallow DOF is extremely effective.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting this challenge, but good luck :)</td>', 'Personally, I feel that borders other than black or white are very distracting...especially since the color kind of matches the grass, and it''s a little awkward-looking.  Otherwise, I really love this shot...you''ve captured a really nice moment, the strength of the wind is very evident and the very shallow DOF is extremely effective. I''m not voting this challenge, but good luck :)', '2006-04-12 04:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305653, 316958, 48524, '<td valign="top">I love the border, it makes it seem like a screenshot from a movie.  The light is amazing, and the mood is wonderful.  Only thing is, filezise compression left a lot of blotches...you really should have used as much of the 150kb limit as you could have :( I also kind of wish the crop was a little further on the left and a little closer on the right to bring the figures further from the center and play off the negative space more, but that''s only a minor detail.  Love the umbrellas.  Excellent capture.<br/> <br/>Not voting this challenge, so good luck.  I hope this places well.</td>', 'I love the border, it makes it seem like a screenshot from a movie.  The light is amazing, and the mood is wonderful.  Only thing is, filezise compression left a lot of blotches...you really should have used as much of the 150kb limit as you could have :( I also kind of wish the crop was a little further on the left and a little closer on the right to bring the figures further from the center and play off the negative space more, but that''s only a minor detail.  Love the umbrellas.  Excellent capture. Not voting this challenge, so good luck.  I hope this places well.', '2006-04-12 04:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305659, 319725, 48524, '<td valign="top">So much negative space...I love it.  Definitely emphasizes your title, the mood is perfect.  Such a lonely-looking figure.<br/> <br/>I wish you didn''t compress the image so much...if you had used the full 150kb filesize limit there wouldn''t be so many blotches from jpg-compressing :(<br/> <br/>I''m not voting this challenge, but good luck, and I hope you do well!</td>', 'So much negative space...I love it.  Definitely emphasizes your title, the mood is perfect.  Such a lonely-looking figure. I wish you didn''t compress the image so much...if you had used the full 150kb filesize limit there wouldn''t be so many blotches from jpg-compressing :( I''m not voting this challenge, but good luck, and I hope you do well!', '2006-04-12 04:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
