(2305902, 319863, 42181, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you let all of those sheep out just so you could get your shot. <br/>What some people will do for a challenge entry ;-)</td>', 'I can''t believe you let all of those sheep out just so you could get your shot. What some people will do for a challenge entry ;-)', '2006-04-12 07:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305917, 318856, 6999, '<td valign="top">Definitely something of an achievement to get the shot at all, although it seems the focus is stronger on the foreground sticks than the bird''s head; a classic case of having a very dificult photograph to get and hoping that people will not pay too much attention to the challenge details?</td>', 'Definitely something of an achievement to get the shot at all, although it seems the focus is stronger on the foreground sticks than the bird''s head; a classic case of having a very dificult photograph to get and hoping that people will not pay too much attention to the challenge details?', '2006-04-12 07:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305918, 320030, 6999, '<td valign="top">i like the moment, the expression, the very strong sense of location and mood; seems a touch forced into the nearly square crop, perhaps.</td>', 'i like the moment, the expression, the very strong sense of location and mood; seems a touch forced into the nearly square crop, perhaps.', '2006-04-12 07:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305921, 317548, 6999, '<td valign="top">The colour becomes such a strong element of a colour photograph that it doesn''t help guide the eye to your subject. The over-exposure isn''t helping - would love to see more texture in those hands.</td>', 'The colour becomes such a strong element of a colour photograph that it doesn''t help guide the eye to your subject. The over-exposure isn''t helping - would love to see more texture in those hands.', '2006-04-12 07:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305924, 319295, 6999, '<td valign="top">Really like this; excellent sense of dynamic and location. Title brings to mind a couple of well remembered books.</td>', 'Really like this; excellent sense of dynamic and location. Title brings to mind a couple of well remembered books.', '2006-04-12 07:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305927, 319869, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is so refreshing, and such a caring image showing friendship.....I like this and it certainly suits the candid challange.....</td>', 'This is so refreshing, and such a caring image showing friendship.....I like this and it certainly suits the candid challange.....', '2006-04-12 07:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2305928, 318568, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure this will be considered properly ''candid'' by most. It has such a strong graphic quality, such geometry, that makes for a fine image, but to me it isn''t referenced to a specific ''moment'' so much as a location.</td>', 'Not sure this will be considered properly ''candid'' by most. It has such a strong graphic quality, such geometry, that makes for a fine image, but to me it isn''t referenced to a specific ''moment'' so much as a location.', '2006-04-12 07:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
