(2306368, 319215, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, not sure what to say.  Brave is one word that comes to mind when I think about your decision to post this.  Yes, it''s just a picture but as you are probably finding out a very touchy subject.  Well done overall but the eyes aren''t really noticable and aren''t as sharp as they could be.  A 5</td>', 'Wow, not sure what to say.  Brave is one word that comes to mind when I think about your decision to post this.  Yes, it''s just a picture but as you are probably finding out a very touchy subject.  Well done overall but the eyes aren''t really noticable and aren''t as sharp as they could be.  A 5', '2006-04-12 10:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
