(2306413, 319708, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is my only 10.  I love the character in the woman''s face. I love the tones (its my own forte`). The tones used are exceptional. The lace adds quite a bit of interest, and it is obvious this photo was not staged, nor had easy candid targets such as children, babies, or animals. It has great focus as well, and you got in close enough to really capture an endearing emotion. Very well done. I hope if any photo makes top three, it is this one.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. This is my only 10.  I love the character in the woman''s face. I love the tones (its my own forte`). The tones used are exceptional. The lace adds quite a bit of interest, and it is obvious this photo was not staged, nor had easy candid targets such as children, babies, or animals. It has great focus as well, and you got in close enough to really capture an endearing emotion. Very well done. I hope if any photo makes top three, it is this one.', '2006-04-12 10:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2306416, 319590, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I see a decent candid moment here.  Better than most others in challenge. However, I can see the usage of neat image, which tells me you must have had to rid of some noise you weren''t happy with. Still a (6) from me. Would have been better in a sepia tone I believe.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. I see a decent candid moment here.  Better than most others in challenge. However, I can see the usage of neat image, which tells me you must have had to rid of some noise you weren''t happy with. Still a (6) from me. Would have been better in a sepia tone I believe.', '2006-04-12 10:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2306420, 319934, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>We all know that older men and women do well in such challenges. This is no exception. However, I would have liked to see this in a deep sepia tone and some HMS used in order to bring out the details more. Could have also used some USM if you hadn''t used it.  Needs to have what you are trying to portray enhanced.  There is quite a bit of interest around the eyes.  It''s a good (6) photo as is.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. We all know that older men and women do well in such challenges. This is no exception. However, I would have liked to see this in a deep sepia tone and some HMS used in order to bring out the details more. Could have also used some USM if you hadn''t used it.  Needs to have what you are trying to portray enhanced.  There is quite a bit of interest around the eyes.  It''s a good (6) photo as is.', '2006-04-12 10:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
