(2306792, 319871, 20530, '<td valign="top">This is one of my choices for a ribbon. I just love everything about it. You''ve captured the essence of, what appears to be a stylish indigent, without resorting to selective desat or a grunge effect. The composition is very active and full of color without appearing busy or overwhelming.<br/> <br/>It''s so "perfect", in fact, that I have my suspicions about how candid it is. I''ve never seen a homeless person in such attire; nor have I seen one drinking their beer without a paper bag. I guess I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and give it a 10.</td>', 'This is one of my choices for a ribbon. I just love everything about it. You''ve captured the essence of, what appears to be a stylish indigent, without resorting to selective desat or a grunge effect. The composition is very active and full of color without appearing busy or overwhelming. It''s so "perfect", in fact, that I have my suspicions about how candid it is. I''ve never seen a homeless person in such attire; nor have I seen one drinking their beer without a paper bag. I guess I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and give it a 10.', '2006-04-12 12:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2306794, 318909, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is cute and endearing, but children are just too easy to capture in a candid. With that being said, there are a million other poses just as worthy when using children that weren''t captured here.  I do like the tones, and the pants and hand in pocket is adorable. Just not right for this challenge to me. Would have liked to see an "out of comfort zone" candid.  A 4 vote.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. This is cute and endearing, but children are just too easy to capture in a candid. With that being said, there are a million other poses just as worthy when using children that weren''t captured here.  I do like the tones, and the pants and hand in pocket is adorable. Just not right for this challenge to me. Would have liked to see an "out of comfort zone" candid.  A 4 vote.', '2006-04-12 12:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
