(2306831, 319183, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh, the animal problem. Whilst not exactly outside the challenge definition, I can''t help but feel that most voters will actually consider it so. Nice shot, although lacking some exposure and processing control around the head and eye.</td>', 'Oh, the animal problem. Whilst not exactly outside the challenge definition, I can''t help but feel that most voters will actually consider it so. Nice shot, although lacking some exposure and processing control around the head and eye.', '2006-04-12 12:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
