(2306992, 319936, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>No wow factors here for me. A bit out of focus, and also seems to me as just a boring shot of people watching a game. There is no one jumping up with enthusiasm, or anything of the like to really make this photo pop. Just a 4 vote from me.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. No wow factors here for me. A bit out of focus, and also seems to me as just a boring shot of people watching a game. There is no one jumping up with enthusiasm, or anything of the like to really make this photo pop. Just a 4 vote from me.', '2006-04-12 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2306993, 319501, 46223, '<td valign="top">no focus. Why not the dog?</td>', 'no focus. Why not the dog?', '2006-04-12 13:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2306995, 318591, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Cute title, but not the best candid. Mans face is out of focus, however does show some emotion.  A 4 vote from me.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. Cute title, but not the best candid. Mans face is out of focus, however does show some emotion.  A 4 vote from me.', '2006-04-12 13:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
