(2307041, 319036, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Older men with characterized faces don''t always say "candid". This one is out of focus, shows no real emotion of despair (he could be tieing his shoes for all I can tell by his face), it is a bit small in size, and just really lacks a good candid quality. Little emotion. Little story told. A 4 vote from me.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. Older men with characterized faces don''t always say "candid". This one is out of focus, shows no real emotion of despair (he could be tieing his shoes for all I can tell by his face), it is a bit small in size, and just really lacks a good candid quality. Little emotion. Little story told. A 4 vote from me.', '2006-04-12 13:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307042, 318568, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice but i would add some more contrast and possibly longer exposure for more effect.</td>', 'Nice but i would add some more contrast and possibly longer exposure for more effect.', '2006-04-12 13:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307045, 319581, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is lovely.  Beautiful tones used.  Love the bright smile, and the guitar adds interest. Nice story being told here of a happy man with his happy hobby.  However, the crop isn''t great. I want that whole hat to show, and of course, the hat is a nightmare for candid photographers and the shadows on the face show that nightmare for this shot. Still the emotion comes through well, and I give it a 7.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. This is lovely.  Beautiful tones used.  Love the bright smile, and the guitar adds interest. Nice story being told here of a happy man with his happy hobby.  However, the crop isn''t great. I want that whole hat to show, and of course, the hat is a nightmare for candid photographers and the shadows on the face show that nightmare for this shot. Still the emotion comes through well, and I give it a 7.', '2006-04-12 13:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307047, 319523, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is boring to me, sorry.  A photographer taking a shot of another photographer is really kind of boring. It has no emotion and little for a story to me. The tones are nice though, and a 4 for the tones.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. This is boring to me, sorry.  A photographer taking a shot of another photographer is really kind of boring. It has no emotion and little for a story to me. The tones are nice though, and a 4 for the tones.', '2006-04-12 13:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307048, 319102, 27524, '<td valign="top">I find it pretty arty... though i would chose bigger size for more effect.</td>', 'I find it pretty arty... though i would chose bigger size for more effect.', '2006-04-12 13:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
