(2307053, 318271, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are way too easy to get candids of. I would have liked to see a photo more out of the comfort zones of many in this challenge, but there are a lot of children and animals.  The eyes of this little girl are pretty, but its a bit out of focus as well. Also, the contrast is a bit off and just too much clashing color. A b/w conversion would have faired better for me. A 4 vote.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. Children are way too easy to get candids of. I would have liked to see a photo more out of the comfort zones of many in this challenge, but there are a lot of children and animals.  The eyes of this little girl are pretty, but its a bit out of focus as well. Also, the contrast is a bit off and just too much clashing color. A b/w conversion would have faired better for me. A 4 vote.', '2006-04-12 13:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
