(2307143, 317625, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a bit to soft around the features for me. There isn''t much of a catch light in his eyes. Either filtered fill-flash or a simple reflecting device was needed to fill in the dark shadows obscuring most of his features. It''s a nice expressive capture but the image quality is a bit lacking for me.</td>', 'This is a bit to soft around the features for me. There isn''t much of a catch light in his eyes. Either filtered fill-flash or a simple reflecting device was needed to fill in the dark shadows obscuring most of his features. It''s a nice expressive capture but the image quality is a bit lacking for me.', '2006-04-12 14:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
