(2307154, 316958, 50745, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot! looks like a movie on a big screen? love the bright burst of color.</td>', 'beautiful shot! looks like a movie on a big screen? love the bright burst of color.', '2006-04-12 14:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307155, 318856, 7322, '<td valign="top">I feel like the owl should have been captured doing something more unexpected or more expressive to be considered candid. To me this is a nature photo. In terms of image quality, I find it a bit overexposed and not quite sharp enough in the crucial area of its eyes. The eyes are what should grab me about this image but in this the glint just isn''t there.</td>', 'I feel like the owl should have been captured doing something more unexpected or more expressive to be considered candid. To me this is a nature photo. In terms of image quality, I find it a bit overexposed and not quite sharp enough in the crucial area of its eyes. The eyes are what should grab me about this image but in this the glint just isn''t there.', '2006-04-12 14:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307158, 318865, 8437, '<td valign="top">Although it''s a good portrait, I don''t consider "looking at the camera" as being candid.<br/>Also, your light needs improvement, as the sky is blending with her hair.</td>', 'Although it''s a good portrait, I don''t consider "looking at the camera" as being candid.Also, your light needs improvement, as the sky is blending with her hair.', '2006-04-12 14:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
