(2307171, 319915, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice but I''d like to see her face. This shot would have benefited from a helper holding some sort of reflector (white poster board, board covered with foil) to fill in the features of her face more. The details in her hands are quite a bit blown out. It looks like good exposure of her hands was sacrificed in order to get a better exposure of her face. There is an overall lack of good detail in the midtones. The cropping is nice.</td>', 'Nice but I''d like to see her face. This shot would have benefited from a helper holding some sort of reflector (white poster board, board covered with foil) to fill in the features of her face more. The details in her hands are quite a bit blown out. It looks like good exposure of her hands was sacrificed in order to get a better exposure of her face. There is an overall lack of good detail in the midtones. The cropping is nice.', '2006-04-12 14:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
