(2307222, 319987, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very cute child, nice image quality, and great choice for angle of view. I''d like it better if she were looking more directly at the viewer. Also, the trees in the background bother me. If they couldn''t be eliminated from the shot by placing the subject where only sky would be visible behind her, then they should have been blurred quite a bit more---something which needs to be done in -camera for this challenge,so that depends largely on what your capable of achieving with the camera set-up you have.</td>', 'Very cute child, nice image quality, and great choice for angle of view. I''d like it better if she were looking more directly at the viewer. Also, the trees in the background bother me. If they couldn''t be eliminated from the shot by placing the subject where only sky would be visible behind her, then they should have been blurred quite a bit more---something which needs to be done in -camera for this challenge,so that depends largely on what your capable of achieving with the camera set-up you have.', '2006-04-12 14:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
