(2307396, 319119, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/> <br/>Very little interest for me I''m afraid.  A bunch of people having lunch, but nothing of any true interest is going on.  A candid, to me, is not just taking any photo of any person or persons that are in a bunch or unknowing of your presence. It should tell a story. Have a point and focus of interest. I am just not finding that here. It''s just a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.  Very little interest for me I''m afraid.  A bunch of people having lunch, but nothing of any true interest is going on.  A candid, to me, is not just taking any photo of any person or persons that are in a bunch or unknowing of your presence. It should tell a story. Have a point and focus of interest. I am just not finding that here. It''s just a 3 for me.', '2006-04-12 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
