(2307422, 317541, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is different, and better than most, but not sure of its candid value to me. A mask hides the real story behind them, and that is the story I really want to see.  If I were to list this in a category, I would probably list it as a b/w and not a candid.  The mask is interesting, and I do like the b/w white, but not for this challenge I''m afraid. It''s a 3 vote from me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is different, and better than most, but not sure of its candid value to me. A mask hides the real story behind them, and that is the story I really want to see.  If I were to list this in a category, I would probably list it as a b/w and not a candid.  The mask is interesting, and I do like the b/w white, but not for this challenge I''m afraid. It''s a 3 vote from me.', '2006-04-12 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
