(2307433, 319961, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is really a shot that can be taken on any street corner in any part of the world. Hats and sunglasses are also a nightmare to candid photographers.  I see no emotion, no story, and just a few people with one on a bike. It''s ok, but no wow factors for me at all. It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is really a shot that can be taken on any street corner in any part of the world. Hats and sunglasses are also a nightmare to candid photographers.  I see no emotion, no story, and just a few people with one on a bike. It''s ok, but no wow factors for me at all. It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-12 15:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307448, 318964, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>A man on a cell phone. This is pretty much all of the USA and easy to capture anywhere.  Too much dead space on the left that really leaves a lot to the imagination when this photo is so busy on the right; and the lighting is really not tended to here. It needed to be toned down and maybe given a complete conversion to b/w or sepia. Focus is lacking as well. I do like the sign about reserved parking though, and at least that gives it a bit of a pop value. A 3 vote from me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. A man on a cell phone. This is pretty much all of the USA and easy to capture anywhere.  Too much dead space on the left that really leaves a lot to the imagination when this photo is so busy on the right; and the lighting is really not tended to here. It needed to be toned down and maybe given a complete conversion to b/w or sepia. Focus is lacking as well. I do like the sign about reserved parking though, and at least that gives it a bit of a pop value. A 3 vote from me.', '2006-04-12 15:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307450, 318306, 55881, '<td valign="top">Nice moment captured. I like it.</td>', 'Nice moment captured. I like it.', '2006-04-12 15:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307452, 319921, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is more portrait than candid. Sleeping babies are about as easy to take candids of as a sqirrel in a tree I''m afraid to say.  Cute child, but little is in focus. I do like the tones. It is just a 3 vote from me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is more portrait than candid. Sleeping babies are about as easy to take candids of as a sqirrel in a tree I''m afraid to say.  Cute child, but little is in focus. I do like the tones. It is just a 3 vote from me.', '2006-04-12 15:42:28.000000', NULL, 1);
