(2307542, 319231, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is just ok for me. Some emotion, and a big event, but children are especially easy to capture candids of and have little fear in showing emotion, even hidden emotion.  It just doesn''t have any wow factors for me. It is a 3 for me.  Needs more focus, and the lighting was not all that interesting.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is just ok for me. Some emotion, and a big event, but children are especially easy to capture candids of and have little fear in showing emotion, even hidden emotion.  It just doesn''t have any wow factors for me. It is a 3 for me.  Needs more focus, and the lighting was not all that interesting.', '2006-04-12 16:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307548, 319108, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are the easiest subjects to use for candids. I seriously doubt you would see an adult hanging from a merrigoround such as this. LOL...BUT THAT would have made a great candid. Whereas, this one is that of a child having fun. Something one can see any day at any park. I do like the tones, and the expression, but it''s just an ok candid for me. One where no comfort zone was left to capture. A 4 vote from me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Children are the easiest subjects to use for candids. I seriously doubt you would see an adult hanging from a merrigoround such as this. LOL...BUT THAT would have made a great candid. Whereas, this one is that of a child having fun. Something one can see any day at any park. I do like the tones, and the expression, but it''s just an ok candid for me. One where no comfort zone was left to capture. A 4 vote from me.', '2006-04-12 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307553, 317552, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Ok, so its a meter man. A little uninteresting for my candid taste. No emotion and no real story being told here. Just some guy. It''s just a 3 vote from me I''m afraid.  The lighting is ok, but maybe trying to set a mood with more b/w tones or sepia would have faired better.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Ok, so its a meter man. A little uninteresting for my candid taste. No emotion and no real story being told here. Just some guy. It''s just a 3 vote from me I''m afraid.  The lighting is ok, but maybe trying to set a mood with more b/w tones or sepia would have faired better.', '2006-04-12 16:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307556, 320029, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>If I were to list this in categories, I would list it as a very good silhouette with a secondary for action.  I would not list it as a candid. It just isn''t that candid to me. I like to see an emotion or a story being told in a persons smile, eyes, face, and close up if possible with candids. This is just a 3 photo for me in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. If I were to list this in categories, I would list it as a very good silhouette with a secondary for action.  I would not list it as a candid. It just isn''t that candid to me. I like to see an emotion or a story being told in a persons smile, eyes, face, and close up if possible with candids. This is just a 3 photo for me in this challenge.', '2006-04-12 16:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307565, 319364, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are the easiest targets for candids. Not much wow factor in them for me unless they are doing something totally out of the ordinary.  All the make up and feathers and costumes really don''t make a candid a candid. The face expression is ok, but to imagine it without all the surroundings and color on her, I would just look at this as a portrait gone bad where your subject turned away from you at the last moment.  Just doesn''t have any wow factors for me. It''s a 3 from me in tech''s and as a candid.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Children are the easiest targets for candids. Not much wow factor in them for me unless they are doing something totally out of the ordinary.  All the make up and feathers and costumes really don''t make a candid a candid. The face expression is ok, but to imagine it without all the surroundings and color on her, I would just look at this as a portrait gone bad where your subject turned away from you at the last moment.  Just doesn''t have any wow factors for me. It''s a 3 from me in tech''s and as a candid.', '2006-04-12 16:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307567, 319146, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>To me this is more like a self portrait, and the tones aren''t very well chosen to me. A b/w conversion would have been much better. I can''t really get anything from this photo by way of story or emotion. It''s a 3 from me.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. To me this is more like a self portrait, and the tones aren''t very well chosen to me. A b/w conversion would have been much better. I can''t really get anything from this photo by way of story or emotion. It''s a 3 from me.', '2006-04-12 16:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307569, 319772, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, red being a difficult color it has traveled up and encompassed the face as well. I see little sharpness, focus, and little expression or emotion in this. I would have liked to have seen it turned to b/w to rid of the red tones. However, with that said, it isn''t that bad for a candid, and I did give it a 4.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Unfortunately, red being a difficult color it has traveled up and encompassed the face as well. I see little sharpness, focus, and little expression or emotion in this. I would have liked to have seen it turned to b/w to rid of the red tones. However, with that said, it isn''t that bad for a candid, and I did give it a 4.', '2006-04-12 16:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
