(2307586, 318584, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is just ok, and to give you an example of why I say it is just ok is because my 6 year old son got a candid himself the other day of a cop actually giving out a ticket. To me that told more of a story theh this photo when the man recieving the ticket wasn''t all that happy.  To me this is just an officer putting her hair behind her ear. No real story, no real emotion, no real wow factor for me. I gave it a 3.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is just ok, and to give you an example of why I say it is just ok is because my 6 year old son got a candid himself the other day of a cop actually giving out a ticket. To me that told more of a story theh this photo when the man recieving the ticket wasn''t all that happy.  To me this is just an officer putting her hair behind her ear. No real story, no real emotion, no real wow factor for me. I gave it a 3.', '2006-04-12 16:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
