(2308037, 318665, 49814, '<td valign="top">excellent capture</td>', 'excellent capture', '2006-04-12 19:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308040, 318501, 49814, '<td valign="top">very interesting</td>', 'very interesting', '2006-04-12 19:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308042, 319485, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Wow. Must have been taken right at sunset. Contrast is off the hook here. BUT, as a candid, it just doesn''t have a ton of interest to me.  Looks somewhat like a portrait gone bad due to the suns position.  It''s ok, but just doesn''t give me the kick I am looking for. It''s a 4 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Wow. Must have been taken right at sunset. Contrast is off the hook here. BUT, as a candid, it just doesn''t have a ton of interest to me.  Looks somewhat like a portrait gone bad due to the suns position.  It''s ok, but just doesn''t give me the kick I am looking for. It''s a 4 for me.', '2006-04-12 19:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308048, 319968, 7322, '<td valign="top">For a candid shot to be successful for me, it should capture either the unexpected or strong emotion,frequently both. For example, unintentional juxtapositions potentially make great candids, be they humorous, or simply thought provoking. Capturing the subject doing something out of character is another example of potential candid material. The other type is a bit easier to find. Those would be the shots that successfully capture strong emotion, be it glee, fury, frustration, pride, etc. This doesn''t really capture any of those qualities. It would help if we could see the man''s expression. The woman doesn''t really provide enough information with her expression to provoke an emotional response in me.</td>', 'For a candid shot to be successful for me, it should capture either the unexpected or strong emotion,frequently both. For example, unintentional juxtapositions potentially make great candids, be they humorous, or simply thought provoking. Capturing the subject doing something out of character is another example of potential candid material. The other type is a bit easier to find. Those would be the shots that successfully capture strong emotion, be it glee, fury, frustration, pride, etc. This doesn''t really capture any of those qualities. It would help if we could see the man''s expression. The woman doesn''t really provide enough information with her expression to provoke an emotional response in me.', '2006-04-12 19:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308054, 318376, 40819, '<td valign="top">How is this a candid?</td>', 'How is this a candid?', '2006-04-12 19:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308056, 318796, 7322, '<td valign="top">The title isn''t enough to make this work for me. It might be okay for the family photo album but it doesn''t really reveal much to me, the objective viewer. His hood just isn''t that amusing to me and there really isn''t anything else to respond to other than his somewhat stern expression. Without any other visual clues to provide context, his expression isn''t really teling much of a story.</td>', 'The title isn''t enough to make this work for me. It might be okay for the family photo album but it doesn''t really reveal much to me, the objective viewer. His hood just isn''t that amusing to me and there really isn''t anything else to respond to other than his somewhat stern expression. Without any other visual clues to provide context, his expression isn''t really teling much of a story.', '2006-04-12 19:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308057, 318000, 40819, '<td valign="top">Obviously the beauty doesn''t really do much manual labor since she has a shinny sparkling new hard hat. OK I guess but it really doesn''t seem candid at all. It might be but it doesn''t really look it.</td>', 'Obviously the beauty doesn''t really do much manual labor since she has a shinny sparkling new hard hat. OK I guess but it really doesn''t seem candid at all. It might be but it doesn''t really look it.', '2006-04-12 19:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308059, 319919, 34192, '<td valign="top">The ultimate in cuteness.  Not your fault, she''s just cute. :)  The lighting makes the shot.  You did well in the B&amp;W conversion.  Frame is heavy for me but who cares.  Composition well done. 8 whoops - bump to 9</td>', 'The ultimate in cuteness.  Not your fault, she''s just cute. :)  The lighting makes the shot.  You did well in the B&W conversion.  Frame is heavy for me but who cares.  Composition well done. 8 whoops - bump to 9', '2006-04-12 19:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308060, 319839, 34192, '<td valign="top">This image is made by his expression - the seriousness of the occasion is completely overwhelmed by his smile.  Crop/composition, POV, DOF all very well done. 8 whoops - bump to 9</td>', 'This image is made by his expression - the seriousness of the occasion is completely overwhelmed by his smile.  Crop/composition, POV, DOF all very well done. 8 whoops - bump to 9', '2006-04-12 19:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308062, 319590, 34192, '<td valign="top">Perfect moment.  She''s the agressive one, the other can''t believe it, he''s taking it like a man.  Pretty cool.  DOF and POV perfect. Colors excellent. 9</td>', 'Perfect moment.  She''s the agressive one, the other can''t believe it, he''s taking it like a man.  Pretty cool.  DOF and POV perfect. Colors excellent. 9', '2006-04-12 19:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308063, 319999, 40819, '<td valign="top">OMG you need to win a ribon for this poor soul. This poor guy must have lost a bet.</td>', 'OMG you need to win a ribon for this poor soul. This poor guy must have lost a bet.', '2006-04-12 19:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308065, 319688, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this in an odd sort of way.  It definitely captures my attention.  Composition, colors, DOF very well done. 8</td>', 'I like this in an odd sort of way.  It definitely captures my attention.  Composition, colors, DOF very well done. 8', '2006-04-12 19:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308066, 319391, 40819, '<td valign="top">Not a candid, I am sure the moon saw you take this picture.</td>', 'Not a candid, I am sure the moon saw you take this picture.', '2006-04-12 19:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308071, 320030, 34192, '<td valign="top">This looks pulled out of an advertisement or movie reel.  Composition and POV are perfect.  Lighting is excellent.  Expressions priceless.  Excellent work! 10</td>', 'This looks pulled out of an advertisement or movie reel.  Composition and POV are perfect.  Lighting is excellent.  Expressions priceless.  Excellent work! 10', '2006-04-12 19:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308072, 318915, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid at all, these birds are very perceptive and I am sure by the looks of this he preened before you took this. He is just too posed.</td>', 'not a candid at all, these birds are very perceptive and I am sure by the looks of this he preened before you took this. He is just too posed.', '2006-04-12 19:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308075, 319585, 40819, '<td valign="top">Oh yea I see that guy on the sled on the island, tight this is a candid.</td>', 'Oh yea I see that guy on the sled on the island, tight this is a candid.', '2006-04-12 19:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308076, 319875, 34192, '<td valign="top">She is androgenous and ageless. She offsets the orange wall well.  Such an arresting mix of soft and hard textures.  Nothing is happening and yet it is all right in the image. 9</td>', 'She is androgenous and ageless. She offsets the orange wall well.  Such an arresting mix of soft and hard textures.  Nothing is happening and yet it is all right in the image. 9', '2006-04-12 19:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308077, 317626, 40819, '<td valign="top">Sorry for your loss.</td>', 'Sorry for your loss.', '2006-04-12 19:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308078, 317626, 7322, '<td valign="top">You can title this however you wish but it still won''t be a candid, IMO. Without a person visiting or tending the shrine, someone that can help me connect more to the subject, I don''t find myself feeling much of an emotional response to this image. The careless, snapshot quality of this provokes more of an indifferent reaction in me that removes me from the reality of what the shrine represents. I''m not sure if that was your intent.</td>', 'You can title this however you wish but it still won''t be a candid, IMO. Without a person visiting or tending the shrine, someone that can help me connect more to the subject, I don''t find myself feeling much of an emotional response to this image. The careless, snapshot quality of this provokes more of an indifferent reaction in me that removes me from the reality of what the shrine represents. I''m not sure if that was your intent.', '2006-04-12 19:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308079, 318388, 54755, '<td valign="top">This looks awfully familiar! Nicollet Ave maybe?! ;) Like how the sun is a natural spotlight on the subject.</td>', 'This looks awfully familiar! Nicollet Ave maybe?! ;) Like how the sun is a natural spotlight on the subject.', '2006-04-12 19:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308082, 318637, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is a moment captured that most people just don''t see as a great moment here at DPC.  I think your timing was perfect and the lighting was working with you.  Crop/composition well done.  Contrast a little high but what can I expect in bright sunlight? 8</td>', 'This is a moment captured that most people just don''t see as a great moment here at DPC.  I think your timing was perfect and the lighting was working with you.  Crop/composition well done.  Contrast a little high but what can I expect in bright sunlight? 8', '2006-04-12 19:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308083, 319204, 40819, '<td valign="top">Not a candid.</td>', 'Not a candid.', '2006-04-12 19:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308085, 319790, 34192, '<td valign="top">This works for me as the reflection shows me what I cannot or am not supposed to see.  Great POV - so often kids are shot from adult heights.  Crop well done. 8</td>', 'This works for me as the reflection shows me what I cannot or am not supposed to see.  Great POV - so often kids are shot from adult heights.  Crop well done. 8', '2006-04-12 19:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308086, 319183, 40819, '<td valign="top">Not a candid</td>', 'Not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308087, 319569, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting travel shot but the human subjects are too far away to make the kind of emotional connection needed for a candid to work, IMO. This doesn''t capture the feelings or mood of any of the people on board.</td>', 'This is an interesting travel shot but the human subjects are too far away to make the kind of emotional connection needed for a candid to work, IMO. This doesn''t capture the feelings or mood of any of the people on board.', '2006-04-12 19:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308090, 319535, 40819, '<td valign="top">Not a candid</td>', 'Not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308094, 318602, 5354, '<td valign="top">Shadows on the Wall - great title, great song</td>', 'Shadows on the Wall - great title, great song', '2006-04-12 19:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308095, 319331, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really like this - the mood works with the clutter of people.  Good timing. 7</td>', 'I really like this - the mood works with the clutter of people.  Good timing. 7', '2006-04-12 19:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308096, 319999, 34134, '<td valign="top">This is fun... poor guy probably feels bad enough having to wear that thing... he''d die if he knew you were taking his picture too. Good job.</td>', 'This is fun... poor guy probably feels bad enough having to wear that thing... he''d die if he knew you were taking his picture too. Good job.', '2006-04-12 19:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308097, 319335, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308100, 319615, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308102, 319977, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness.  I like the seen and the unseen. 7</td>', 'I like the starkness.  I like the seen and the unseen. 7', '2006-04-12 19:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308103, 319227, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308105, 319158, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308106, 318577, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308107, 320015, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308109, 318865, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308112, 318669, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would work much better if we could see the boy''s face. This side view is somewhat removed and impersonal. For me, with this type of candid, I want to be transported back to childhood---to remember the pure, single-minded enjoyment of an icecream cone. While there are exceptions, it is generally good practice to photograph children closer to their eye-level. This has the effect of showing the child''s perspective and drawing the viewer into his world.</td>', 'This would work much better if we could see the boy''s face. This side view is somewhat removed and impersonal. For me, with this type of candid, I want to be transported back to childhood---to remember the pure, single-minded enjoyment of an icecream cone. While there are exceptions, it is generally good practice to photograph children closer to their eye-level. This has the effect of showing the child''s perspective and drawing the viewer into his world.', '2006-04-12 19:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308116, 317890, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308121, 319642, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308125, 319060, 40819, '<td valign="top">Basic editing? Hmmm</td>', 'Basic editing? Hmmm', '2006-04-12 19:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308126, 320002, 7322, '<td valign="top">The subjects are too far removed from the viewer (in this case, me) to provoke the type of emotional response that,IMO, makes for a successful candid. In a candid I look for either the unexpected or for the subject(s) to have been captured revealing a strong emotion, be it glee, fury, pride, frustration, etc.</td>', 'The subjects are too far removed from the viewer (in this case, me) to provoke the type of emotional response that,IMO, makes for a successful candid. In a candid I look for either the unexpected or for the subject(s) to have been captured revealing a strong emotion, be it glee, fury, pride, frustration, etc.', '2006-04-12 19:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308128, 319619, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308131, 319117, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308134, 319619, 34192, '<td valign="top">Odd toning in the background.  Would have liked a complete desat to B&amp;W rather than the partial desat shown here. Picture is very sharp - well done.  Not to sure about its fit in this challenge.</td>', 'Odd toning in the background.  Would have liked a complete desat to B&W rather than the partial desat shown here. Picture is very sharp - well done.  Not to sure about its fit in this challenge.', '2006-04-12 19:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308137, 318501, 75713, '<td valign="top">a special child - with the eyes of an old soul - very well photographed -</td>', 'a special child - with the eyes of an old soul - very well photographed -', '2006-04-12 19:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308138, 319955, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308139, 319955, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition but find the softness distracting.</td>', 'I really like the composition but find the softness distracting.', '2006-04-12 19:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308140, 319806, 75713, '<td valign="top">This is so precious... you have to get it in a sports mag - 10 and I want a print too</td>', 'This is so precious... you have to get it in a sports mag - 10 and I want a print too', '2006-04-12 19:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308141, 319708, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very engaging subject and I love her smile. My gripe is, since she is not smiling directly into the camera (therefore, at me, the viewer), I''d like to see who she is smiling at. I''m not quite as drawn in as I should be.</td>', 'This is a very engaging subject and I love her smile. My gripe is, since she is not smiling directly into the camera (therefore, at me, the viewer), I''d like to see who she is smiling at. I''m not quite as drawn in as I should be.', '2006-04-12 19:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308142, 318856, 34192, '<td valign="top">Colors are good.  This must be a young owl?  Not sure it fits too well with the challenge but an interesting take none the less.</td>', 'Colors are good.  This must be a young owl?  Not sure it fits too well with the challenge but an interesting take none the less.', '2006-04-12 19:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308143, 317041, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308145, 318376, 34192, '<td valign="top">nice colors and detail.  For me, it doesn''t quite fit the challenge but it is an interesting take on it.</td>', 'nice colors and detail.  For me, it doesn''t quite fit the challenge but it is an interesting take on it.', '2006-04-12 19:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308147, 319117, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of the moon.  Not quite sure it qualifies for the challenge but the detail is incredible.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of the moon.  Not quite sure it qualifies for the challenge but the detail is incredible.', '2006-04-12 19:37:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2308148, 319872, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I like this. I think it has much interest to it with the net and the splash, and even the bird. But the man is so obscured. I would have loved this from another angle to get the face of the man as he threw the net.  I still give it a 5 though, for interest value and technicals.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. I like this. I think it has much interest to it with the net and the splash, and even the bird. But the man is so obscured. I would have loved this from another angle to get the face of the man as he threw the net.  I still give it a 5 though, for interest value and technicals.', '2006-04-12 19:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308151, 320041, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308153, 318915, 34192, '<td valign="top">I wish the bird was in slightly sharper focus.  Composition and colors are excellent.  I think this is a slight stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'I wish the bird was in slightly sharper focus.  Composition and colors are excellent.  I think this is a slight stretch for the challenge.', '2006-04-12 19:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308154, 317041, 34192, '<td valign="top">Honestly, since pots can''t move or pose, I don''t really see this as a candid.  I really like the background but find the placement of the pots, side to side, a little static.  Also, the point of view is high - maybe bringing it down a little on your next attempt would add some depth.  The lighting is good.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Honestly, since pots can''t move or pose, I don''t really see this as a candid.  I really like the background but find the placement of the pots, side to side, a little static.  Also, the point of view is high - maybe bringing it down a little on your next attempt would add some depth.  The lighting is good.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-04-12 19:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308156, 319195, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is a good image for the candid. Nice dof on the couple. I like the dog, it gives interest.  Background is quite grainy, but overall it is a good candid photo.  A 5 from me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is a good image for the candid. Nice dof on the couple. I like the dog, it gives interest.  Background is quite grainy, but overall it is a good candid photo.  A 5 from me.', '2006-04-12 19:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308157, 317419, 34192, '<td valign="top">If their faces had been in focus, this would be an interesting shot.  I think your camera picked something else. Works as a candid.</td>', 'If their faces had been in focus, this would be an interesting shot.  I think your camera picked something else. Works as a candid.', '2006-04-12 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308158, 318095, 40819, '<td valign="top">not a candid</td>', 'not a candid', '2006-04-12 19:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308160, 319585, 34192, '<td valign="top">pretty picture but I see it as more of a scenic than a candid.  The blues are excellent as is the composition.</td>', 'pretty picture but I see it as more of a scenic than a candid.  The blues are excellent as is the composition.', '2006-04-12 19:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308161, 318099, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Poor guy. Ok, well, although it is a good candid, the shot itself lacks for me in technicals. I hate to be one of those tech-maniacs who comment incessantly on the tiniest detail being off the cuff, but overall this photo is just too dark. It loses the translation in that darkness between man, sign, and feel. I gave it a 5 though, cause it was a capture that makes for a good candid.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Poor guy. Ok, well, although it is a good candid, the shot itself lacks for me in technicals. I hate to be one of those tech-maniacs who comment incessantly on the tiniest detail being off the cuff, but overall this photo is just too dark. It loses the translation in that darkness between man, sign, and feel. I gave it a 5 though, cause it was a capture that makes for a good candid.', '2006-04-12 19:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308163, 319728, 34192, '<td valign="top">Just not quite enough to give me a good view.  I like what I can see, I just wish I saw a little more.</td>', 'Just not quite enough to give me a good view.  I like what I can see, I just wish I saw a little more.', '2006-04-12 19:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308164, 318698, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Even though they are at a bit of a distance from the viewer and in near-sillouhette, the men have been captured in such a way that their postures, and the storyteller''s gesture provide most of the visual clues necessary to tell a visual story and provoke an emotional response in the viewer. The boat, the beach, and the sunset provide the environmental context. Excellent job. My favorite so far.</td>', 'Very nice. Even though they are at a bit of a distance from the viewer and in near-sillouhette, the men have been captured in such a way that their postures, and the storyteller''s gesture provide most of the visual clues necessary to tell a visual story and provoke an emotional response in the viewer. The boat, the beach, and the sunset provide the environmental context. Excellent job. My favorite so far.', '2006-04-12 19:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308166, 318860, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the B&amp;W conversion.  I think the image is a little out of focus.</td>', 'I like the composition and the B&W conversion.  I think the image is a little out of focus.', '2006-04-12 19:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308168, 318388, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great catch on this one!  Good eye!</td>', 'Great catch on this one!  Good eye!', '2006-04-12 19:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308174, 319904, 34192, '<td valign="top">This would be excellent if not for the camera shakesoftness.  Subject, composition, and toning are excellent but something like this needs to be in better focus.</td>', 'This would be excellent if not for the camera shakesoftness.  Subject, composition, and toning are excellent but something like this needs to be in better focus.', '2006-04-12 19:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308175, 319517, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>A good candid. The man does look a bit out of place being alone in the a mall though. It is more not like "watching life pass by" but "where the hell is my wife!". LOL....These guys, from my husband working in a nursing home, can be quite spunky. LOL..BUT, because he looks out of sorts I do like it as a candid.  I also like the tones. It''s a 6 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. A good candid. The man does look a bit out of place being alone in the a mall though. It is more not like "watching life pass by" but "where the hell is my wife!". LOL....These guys, from my husband working in a nursing home, can be quite spunky. LOL..BUT, because he looks out of sorts I do like it as a candid.  I also like the tones. It''s a 6 for me.', '2006-04-12 19:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308177, 318575, 55881, '<td valign="top">LoL! This is a humourous shot! Hahahaha!</td>', 'LoL! This is a humourous shot! Hahahaha!', '2006-04-12 19:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308181, 320030, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, natural expression captured on the woman. You''ve included enough background to provide the viewer with some contextual clues. I onlly wish the guy''s eyes weren''t closed.</td>', 'Beautiful, natural expression captured on the woman. You''ve included enough background to provide the viewer with some contextual clues. I onlly wish the guy''s eyes weren''t closed.', '2006-04-12 19:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308183, 319108, 55881, '<td valign="top">I like the emotion you''ve captured! 10 out of 10, how about that? :)</td>', 'I like the emotion you''ve captured! 10 out of 10, how about that? :)', '2006-04-12 19:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308191, 319708, 55881, '<td valign="top">I felt her emotion. Nicely done.</td>', 'I felt her emotion. Nicely done.', '2006-04-12 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308194, 318104, 55881, '<td valign="top">This shot is quite noisy and I see nothing in it.</td>', 'This shot is quite noisy and I see nothing in it.', '2006-04-12 19:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308196, 318143, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is a good candid but not a great candid.  The colors work, the composition works, its in focus.  But, I want something a little more.  I can see you know how to use your camera.  And I''m not saying I am an expert at candids - far from it.  But show me something I don''t see a million times a day.  Like the guy in the back picking his nose.  Or a person laying in the sidewalk.  You know - capture my attention.  Make me want to study the picture longer.  The depth of field is excellent BTW.  I almost wish those people weren''t in the way so I could see the rest of the scene.  No offense to those people, but they aren''t that interesting.  You have to make THEM the scene.  For me, they are in the way of it.  Hope that makes sense. 6</td>', 'This is a good candid but not a great candid.  The colors work, the composition works, its in focus.  But, I want something a little more.  I can see you know how to use your camera.  And I''m not saying I am an expert at candids - far from it.  But show me something I don''t see a million times a day.  Like the guy in the back picking his nose.  Or a person laying in the sidewalk.  You know - capture my attention.  Make me want to study the picture longer.  The depth of field is excellent BTW.  I almost wish those people weren''t in the way so I could see the rest of the scene.  No offense to those people, but they aren''t that interesting.  You have to make THEM the scene.  For me, they are in the way of it.  Hope that makes sense. 6', '2006-04-12 19:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308198, 319232, 55881, '<td valign="top">Her eyes aren''t clear enough, abit wasted.</td>', 'Her eyes aren''t clear enough, abit wasted.', '2006-04-12 19:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308200, 319870, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>An ok candid for me. I do like the tones, but just not a lot of interest here for me. Nothing pops. I do like the rowboat, but I guess I am looking for a corrulation between the rower and the boat. Would have been really nice to see the expression while rowing and the strength from that portrayed, but then that is the photo that isn''t shown so I won''t vote based on that. I do give this a 5 though for tones and techs.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. An ok candid for me. I do like the tones, but just not a lot of interest here for me. Nothing pops. I do like the rowboat, but I guess I am looking for a corrulation between the rower and the boat. Would have been really nice to see the expression while rowing and the strength from that portrayed, but then that is the photo that isn''t shown so I won''t vote based on that. I do give this a 5 though for tones and techs.', '2006-04-12 19:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308201, 320015, 55881, '<td valign="top">Nice vantage point!</td>', 'Nice vantage point!', '2006-04-12 19:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308205, 319314, 34192, '<td valign="top">ARGH!  His brother cut off his hand!  He can''t point anymore!  No seriously.  Something you might watch out for in the future.  Like telephone pole heads.  Well composed otherwise.  DOF works for image, POV well done. 6</td>', 'ARGH!  His brother cut off his hand!  He can''t point anymore!  No seriously.  Something you might watch out for in the future.  Like telephone pole heads.  Well composed otherwise.  DOF works for image, POV well done. 6', '2006-04-12 19:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308206, 317972, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Nice color. Nice contrast. But those darn glasses. They are really a nightmare for the candid photographer.  Nice expression otherwise though, although I have to say it does look posed rather than captured. Overall, a 5 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Nice color. Nice contrast. But those darn glasses. They are really a nightmare for the candid photographer.  Nice expression otherwise though, although I have to say it does look posed rather than captured. Overall, a 5 for me.', '2006-04-12 19:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308207, 319812, 55881, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice. :) 7?</td>', 'Pretty nice. :) 7?', '2006-04-12 19:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308213, 319388, 34192, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and the colors.  The softness doesn''t thrill me for this image but I get the feeling he just turned around to face you.  Probably ''cause the expression.  Cute kid. 6</td>', 'Like the composition and the colors.  The softness doesn''t thrill me for this image but I get the feeling he just turned around to face you.  Probably ''cause the expression.  Cute kid. 6', '2006-04-12 19:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308214, 317025, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are precious. They are darling and a great candid can be had from them any day of any week.  This is one example of that. However, they are also easy targets for candids, and I particularly care to see candids more outside that comfort zone.  I do like the tones and the b/w.  Nice dof. But little interest or pop for me. It''s a 4 from me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Children are precious. They are darling and a great candid can be had from them any day of any week.  This is one example of that. However, they are also easy targets for candids, and I particularly care to see candids more outside that comfort zone.  I do like the tones and the b/w.  Nice dof. But little interest or pop for me. It''s a 4 from me.', '2006-04-12 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308222, 317025, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is technically good and the composition works. I don''t feel that it quite captures a sense of glee, or playfulness. The boys'' expressions aren''t communicating much in this capture. It is very nice but not great, IMO.</td>', 'This is technically good and the composition works. I don''t feel that it quite captures a sense of glee, or playfulness. The boys'' expressions aren''t communicating much in this capture. It is very nice but not great, IMO.', '2006-04-12 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308246, 318242, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I like this one, but don''t like the tones. I would like to see more crop and a b/w or sepia conversion, but I am partial to that style whereas others aren''t much for it. I like the interest in the hands here, and the womans dress. There isn''t much going on otherwise facial wise. It''s an ok candid for me. A 5 vote.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. I like this one, but don''t like the tones. I would like to see more crop and a b/w or sepia conversion, but I am partial to that style whereas others aren''t much for it. I like the interest in the hands here, and the womans dress. There isn''t much going on otherwise facial wise. It''s an ok candid for me. A 5 vote.', '2006-04-12 20:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308253, 318809, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I like the b/w conversion. The lighting is good. Decent focus. I don''t find a lot of interest here though in the faces. I think I would rather see what they are looking at. LOL...It''s an ok candid. Just a 5 for me though.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. I like the b/w conversion. The lighting is good. Decent focus. I don''t find a lot of interest here though in the faces. I think I would rather see what they are looking at. LOL...It''s an ok candid. Just a 5 for me though.', '2006-04-12 20:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308259, 319739, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is a bit strange for me as a candid. It''s okkkk, but the only real interest is not in the face or emotion, but the hair and tattoos. I think you took a photo of this cause you think it is more weird or shocking then as a candid. For me, I prefer to see the faces and emotion or interest in that area for a candid, or something in the photo that sparks me to see that interest immediately.  Dress and hair is only part of it for me.  I gave it a 5.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is a bit strange for me as a candid. It''s okkkk, but the only real interest is not in the face or emotion, but the hair and tattoos. I think you took a photo of this cause you think it is more weird or shocking then as a candid. For me, I prefer to see the faces and emotion or interest in that area for a candid, or something in the photo that sparks me to see that interest immediately.  Dress and hair is only part of it for me.  I gave it a 5.', '2006-04-12 20:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308265, 318733, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are so easy to get candids from.  This is cute, but there is little interest for me as a candid. More portrait style to me, even though she isn''t looking right at the camera.  It''s pretty and cute, but doesn''t speak volumes to me as a candid. It''s a 4 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Children are so easy to get candids from.  This is cute, but there is little interest for me as a candid. More portrait style to me, even though she isn''t looking right at the camera.  It''s pretty and cute, but doesn''t speak volumes to me as a candid. It''s a 4 for me.', '2006-04-12 20:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308271, 318733, 34192, '<td valign="top">What I love about this image is the clarity.  No sharpening artifacts, and its not soft - perfect balance.  The subdued lighting (cloudy?) works excellently here and the pink sweater compliments the red of the tulips.  I almost missed the second child''s (please god let it be a child) head which sows me that the central focus is right where it should be.  Well composed and well taken. 8</td>', 'What I love about this image is the clarity.  No sharpening artifacts, and its not soft - perfect balance.  The subdued lighting (cloudy?) works excellently here and the pink sweater compliments the red of the tulips.  I almost missed the second child''s (please god let it be a child) head which sows me that the central focus is right where it should be.  Well composed and well taken. 8', '2006-04-12 20:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308272, 318062, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is just alright for me.  The hair gives interest, but little else exudes from this photo of interest other than three people talking. It''s a candid, and does meet challenge in that regard, but just not the kind of a candid I prefer. I like to see something in the photo that speaks more to me.  It''s a 4 for me on this.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is just alright for me.  The hair gives interest, but little else exudes from this photo of interest other than three people talking. It''s a candid, and does meet challenge in that regard, but just not the kind of a candid I prefer. I like to see something in the photo that speaks more to me.  It''s a 4 for me on this.', '2006-04-12 20:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308274, 319926, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww. . . what a cute photo!   He looks so bewildered.   I love the detail of the sand all over his feet.   Great candid moment!</td>', 'Awwwwww. . . what a cute photo!   He looks so bewildered.   I love the detail of the sand all over his feet.   Great candid moment!', '2006-04-12 20:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308276, 319115, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are too easy as targets for candids. I do like the dof on this, and the expression is cute, but its a shot anyone can get any day of any week.  It''s just ok for me. I prefer to see candids with a much deeper volume of emotion/feel/interest.  This to me is just another cute shot of a child. I hope that doesn''t sound harsh to you, but I just have higher expectations for a candid. It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Children are too easy as targets for candids. I do like the dof on this, and the expression is cute, but its a shot anyone can get any day of any week.  It''s just ok for me. I prefer to see candids with a much deeper volume of emotion/feel/interest.  This to me is just another cute shot of a child. I hope that doesn''t sound harsh to you, but I just have higher expectations for a candid. It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-12 20:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308278, 319916, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this I hate this I love this I hate this.  This is seriously excellent work.  Still bouncing between wall and ground.  High contrast works.  Is it candid?  Who cares.  The answer is yes in my book.  Would have liked a better title but I can''t think of one either. 10</td>', 'I love this I hate this I love this I hate this.  This is seriously excellent work.  Still bouncing between wall and ground.  High contrast works.  Is it candid?  Who cares.  The answer is yes in my book.  Would have liked a better title but I can''t think of one either. 10', '2006-04-12 20:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308286, 318568, 34192, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of those posters I look at while smoking... oh, nevermind.  Excellent timing.  Tripod?  Must be.  So wonderfully tubular.  B&amp;W conversion very well done.  Crop and composition excellent. 9</td>', 'Reminds me of those posters I look at while smoking... oh, nevermind.  Excellent timing.  Tripod?  Must be.  So wonderfully tubular.  B&W conversion very well done.  Crop and composition excellent. 9', '2006-04-12 20:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308290, 319157, 34192, '<td valign="top">The oddness of the point of view and crop really make this image work for me.  The toning is excellent.  I want to know how you left those two green pots - I believe that somehow, they add meaning to this, but I haven''t figured out the storyline yet.  Excellent focus BTW. 10</td>', 'The oddness of the point of view and crop really make this image work for me.  The toning is excellent.  I want to know how you left those two green pots - I believe that somehow, they add meaning to this, but I haven''t figured out the storyline yet.  Excellent focus BTW. 10', '2006-04-12 20:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308313, 319921, 13091, '<td valign="top">So cute! Lovely baby. His father is certainly a beautiful man.</td>', 'So cute! Lovely baby. His father is certainly a beautiful man.', '2006-04-12 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308328, 319987, 6999, '<td valign="top">Stunning quality here - detail focus, treatment, processing are exemplary. It''s hard to get excited about shots of kids though, however well done.</td>', 'Stunning quality here - detail focus, treatment, processing are exemplary. It''s hard to get excited about shots of kids though, however well done.', '2006-04-12 20:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
