(2308338, 317548, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is an ok candid, but has very little interest or pop to me. A woman reading and sitting on a bench is just to uninteresting of a shot.  It''s a candid, and does meet challenge, has good technicals as red is hard to photograph, but it is just not my particular interest for a candid. It''s a 4 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is an ok candid, but has very little interest or pop to me. A woman reading and sitting on a bench is just to uninteresting of a shot.  It''s a candid, and does meet challenge, has good technicals as red is hard to photograph, but it is just not my particular interest for a candid. It''s a 4 for me.', '2006-04-12 20:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308341, 319629, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is ok for me. I wish there was more focus on the face, but the guitar gives interest. It''s just ok for me though. Perhaps a tonal change to b/w with attention to H/M/S would have been more effective or to my liking. It''s a 4 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is ok for me. I wish there was more focus on the face, but the guitar gives interest. It''s just ok for me though. Perhaps a tonal change to b/w with attention to H/M/S would have been more effective or to my liking. It''s a 4 for me.', '2006-04-12 20:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308348, 319413, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is a decent candid with decent interest. I like the guy to the left, but would have liked to see more of what he was doing. Looks like he is getting up. I would have prefered the guy more in the shot and the girl at the distance. Can you go back and get this reversed? LOL..Just kidding. Its very dark where he is, but it does add interest and draws the eye to him.  Nice focus. The colors are good. It''s ok for me. I give it a 6.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is a decent candid with decent interest. I like the guy to the left, but would have liked to see more of what he was doing. Looks like he is getting up. I would have prefered the guy more in the shot and the girl at the distance. Can you go back and get this reversed? LOL..Just kidding. Its very dark where he is, but it does add interest and draws the eye to him.  Nice focus. The colors are good. It''s ok for me. I give it a 6.', '2006-04-12 20:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308357, 319060, 55738, '<td valign="top">Way too processed for my taste... It makes the photo almost unrecognizable... sorry.</td>', 'Way too processed for my taste... It makes the photo almost unrecognizable... sorry.', '2006-04-12 20:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308360, 319812, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I can relate to the title. LOL..<br/> <br/>Ok well, children and candids really go hand in hand. They are just far too easy to capture.  This one is sorely out of focus though, and that takes away from the shot. It really needed to be reshot, and I am quite sure the subject would have been no wiser had it been. Sometimes the LCD can fool us, and I think that may have happened to you. It''s just a 3 for me I''m afraid. It''s just to technically off the mark.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. I can relate to the title. LOL.. Ok well, children and candids really go hand in hand. They are just far too easy to capture.  This one is sorely out of focus though, and that takes away from the shot. It really needed to be reshot, and I am quite sure the subject would have been no wiser had it been. Sometimes the LCD can fool us, and I think that may have happened to you. It''s just a 3 for me I''m afraid. It''s just to technically off the mark.', '2006-04-12 20:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308362, 317658, 55738, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit too bright.  I also wish it had been larger.  The colors are nice though.</td>', 'It''s a bit too bright.  I also wish it had been larger.  The colors are nice though.', '2006-04-12 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308369, 319619, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, but I didn''t even see the bee until I read the title and looked for it.  It gets really lost in the B&amp;W.</td>', 'This is a nice composition, but I didn''t even see the bee until I read the title and looked for it.  It gets really lost in the B&W.', '2006-04-12 20:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308373, 319002, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice work - especially in the processing. There is some sense of character, which makes a change from photographs of street people as a shortcut (and easy-cut) to ''gritty reality'' for the masses.</td>', 'Nice work - especially in the processing. There is some sense of character, which makes a change from photographs of street people as a shortcut (and easy-cut) to ''gritty reality'' for the masses.', '2006-04-12 20:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308376, 319215, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost worth shooting, so to speak.</td>', 'Almost worth shooting, so to speak.', '2006-04-12 20:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308377, 317541, 55738, '<td valign="top">this is spooky!</td>', 'this is spooky!', '2006-04-12 20:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308389, 318309, 6999, '<td valign="top">Without white-trouser man, you''d have someone almost replicating the shape and location of the figure on his sign: surely an opportunity missed? I''m unsure of your cropping - the two figures are a touch too centrally placed to my eye, and I don''t get enough impact from the architecture to warrant that, I think. Besides all of which, still streets ahead of most shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Without white-trouser man, you''d have someone almost replicating the shape and location of the figure on his sign: surely an opportunity missed? I''m unsure of your cropping - the two figures are a touch too centrally placed to my eye, and I don''t get enough impact from the architecture to warrant that, I think. Besides all of which, still streets ahead of most shots in this challenge.', '2006-04-12 20:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308390, 319619, 6999, '<td valign="top">Such a graceful, sensitive image, and such interesting processing.</td>', 'Such a graceful, sensitive image, and such interesting processing.', '2006-04-12 20:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308396, 319535, 39057, '<td valign="top">While I do believe an animal can be in a candid shot...I feel this swan''s "back" may be a little overblown. I do like the drop of water coming from the face.<br/> <br/>The setting with all the bush and grass add to this being a "candid" shot.</td>', 'While I do believe an animal can be in a candid shot...I feel this swan''s "back" may be a little overblown. I do like the drop of water coming from the face. The setting with all the bush and grass add to this being a "candid" shot.', '2006-04-12 20:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
