(2309006, 318577, 56765, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the colors in the bird. The background could be a little plainer, but overall pretty good.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the colors in the bird. The background could be a little plainer, but overall pretty good.', '2006-04-13 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309008, 319820, 56765, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a little too much going on in the picture.  I don''t know what to focus on.</td>', 'I think there''s a little too much going on in the picture.  I don''t know what to focus on.', '2006-04-13 01:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309012, 317746, 56765, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. I like how the background is blurred out. The "hair" around her head has an interesting color to it as well.</td>', 'I like this shot. I like how the background is blurred out. The "hair" around her head has an interesting color to it as well.', '2006-04-13 01:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309026, 318421, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice pic. looks like an adidas ad</td>', 'nice pic. looks like an adidas ad', '2006-04-13 01:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309034, 319102, 22301, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea for a picture but i would have bumped the contrast up a lot to cut through the fog more.</td>', 'I really like this idea for a picture but i would have bumped the contrast up a lot to cut through the fog more.', '2006-04-13 01:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309038, 318354, 22301, '<td valign="top">This pic is great but you should try a title that doesn''t say exactly what the photo is. but still give it a 6.</td>', 'This pic is great but you should try a title that doesn''t say exactly what the photo is. but still give it a 6.', '2006-04-13 01:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309041, 318904, 55738, '<td valign="top">I wish it had been in focus more...  This probably also would have benefited from being more tightly framed on just one of the sleeping people...</td>', 'I wish it had been in focus more...  This probably also would have benefited from being more tightly framed on just one of the sleeping people...', '2006-04-13 01:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309042, 319200, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is too backlit, since I can''t really see the expression on the subject''s face, there''s not a lot of emotion in the photo...</td>', 'This is too backlit, since I can''t really see the expression on the subject''s face, there''s not a lot of emotion in the photo...', '2006-04-13 01:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309045, 320004, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is slightly out of focus, and the fact that there are girls in costume behind the girl who is not in costume makes it look like this was taken a little too late or a little too early.</td>', 'This is slightly out of focus, and the fact that there are girls in costume behind the girl who is not in costume makes it look like this was taken a little too late or a little too early.', '2006-04-13 01:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309046, 319283, 55738, '<td valign="top">There''s a little too much head room.  It would have been better had it been framed tighter...</td>', 'There''s a little too much head room.  It would have been better had it been framed tighter...', '2006-04-13 01:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309047, 317416, 22301, '<td valign="top">I would try a smaller border or not at all, most voters dont like them.  I think in this photo the space taken up by the border would have been better used to have a larger version of the actual image so that a viewer could look more at the details of the child. But i do really like how it is cropped/framed</td>', 'I would try a smaller border or not at all, most voters dont like them.  I think in this photo the space taken up by the border would have been better used to have a larger version of the actual image so that a viewer could look more at the details of the child. But i do really like how it is cropped/framed', '2006-04-13 01:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309048, 320015, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  My highest rating yet.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  My highest rating yet.', '2006-04-13 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309051, 318964, 55738, '<td valign="top">The contrast is a little high on this...  The mood would have been nicer had it been a little lower I think...</td>', 'The contrast is a little high on this...  The mood would have been nicer had it been a little lower I think...', '2006-04-13 01:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309062, 318865, 55738, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the top of the frame draws my eyes away from her eyes...</td>', 'The brightness of the top of the frame draws my eyes away from her eyes...', '2006-04-13 01:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309063, 319658, 55738, '<td valign="top">I only wish this had been bigger so that I would have seen it better...</td>', 'I only wish this had been bigger so that I would have seen it better...', '2006-04-13 01:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309072, 319930, 55738, '<td valign="top">Too processed looking.  It made it very noisy...</td>', 'Too processed looking.  It made it very noisy...', '2006-04-13 01:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309074, 319590, 22301, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture of the moment but the skin tones appear to be overdone in some sort of noise filtration software.</td>', 'This is a great capture of the moment but the skin tones appear to be overdone in some sort of noise filtration software.', '2006-04-13 01:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309076, 318602, 55738, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you intended it, but the chipped paint nicely mirrors a man and a woman.  This is really nice composition...</td>', 'I don''t know if you intended it, but the chipped paint nicely mirrors a man and a woman.  This is really nice composition...', '2006-04-13 01:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309080, 319904, 55738, '<td valign="top">I just wish it wasn''t so grainy...</td>', 'I just wish it wasn''t so grainy...', '2006-04-13 01:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
