(2309114, 317890, 55738, '<td valign="top">OK, now that''s a cute photo!  Love it!</td>', 'OK, now that''s a cute photo!  Love it!', '2006-04-13 01:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309119, 320029, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is actually kind of a scary photo.  I really like it...</td>', 'This is actually kind of a scary photo.  I really like it...', '2006-04-13 02:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309127, 318865, 56752, '<td valign="top">Issues of the shot being or not being candid aside, I find personally that the blown highlights in the hair is fairly distracting, as it kind of opens up a ''hole'' from her hairline to the sky. Otherwise, good shot.</td>', 'Issues of the shot being or not being candid aside, I find personally that the blown highlights in the hair is fairly distracting, as it kind of opens up a ''hole'' from her hairline to the sky. Otherwise, good shot.', '2006-04-13 02:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309135, 319374, 56752, '<td valign="top">Outstanding picture</td>', 'Outstanding picture', '2006-04-13 02:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309141, 319590, 56752, '<td valign="top">On the technical side, it appears that noise reduction was applied to this image; I don''t necessarily think grain would have been a bad thing for this image, and preserving all the detail would be ideal for a shot of this viewing size. Good catch on the moment though.</td>', 'On the technical side, it appears that noise reduction was applied to this image; I don''t necessarily think grain would have been a bad thing for this image, and preserving all the detail would be ideal for a shot of this viewing size. Good catch on the moment though.', '2006-04-13 02:11:02.000000', NULL, 1);
