(2309285, 319601, 47597, '<td valign="top">The bright sunshine on her legs distracts me. Since half the subject is in shadow, and the other half is glaringly bright, I find it hard to see what the central subject of the picture is at a first glance. If you had composed the shot so that only her face was in the frame, it would have been a lot better, I think.</td>', 'The bright sunshine on her legs distracts me. Since half the subject is in shadow, and the other half is glaringly bright, I find it hard to see what the central subject of the picture is at a first glance. If you had composed the shot so that only her face was in the frame, it would have been a lot better, I think.', '2006-04-13 02:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309286, 318713, 47597, '<td valign="top">There is no "wow" in this picture. It looks like a snapshot.</td>', 'There is no "wow" in this picture. It looks like a snapshot.', '2006-04-13 02:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309288, 318869, 47597, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the frame/border on this pic. The subject is quite cute, but looks a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I really don''t like the frame/border on this pic. The subject is quite cute, but looks a bit out of focus.', '2006-04-13 02:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309289, 318918, 47597, '<td valign="top">Cute kid. This pic would have been better if you had sharpened the child''s face more.</td>', 'Cute kid. This pic would have been better if you had sharpened the child''s face more.', '2006-04-13 02:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309292, 319935, 47597, '<td valign="top">The pic doesn''t seem properly level. Try rotating it clockwise a bit. There is also nothing to "wow" me in the composition.</td>', 'The pic doesn''t seem properly level. Try rotating it clockwise a bit. There is also nothing to "wow" me in the composition.', '2006-04-13 03:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309293, 318096, 47597, '<td valign="top">There are some distracting distortions (or artifacts) in the picture - almost like a ghosting around the edge of the person. Also the blur at the bottom left is quite off-putting.</td>', 'There are some distracting distortions (or artifacts) in the picture - almost like a ghosting around the edge of the person. Also the blur at the bottom left is quite off-putting.', '2006-04-13 03:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309294, 319262, 47597, '<td valign="top">Nice composition choice. I find the hazy background a bit boring.</td>', 'Nice composition choice. I find the hazy background a bit boring.', '2006-04-13 03:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309296, 319656, 47597, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes. I am a bit distracted by the crop which cut off half his head. Perhaps a crop which included the whole head and less of his body would have been better.</td>', 'Nice eyes. I am a bit distracted by the crop which cut off half his head. Perhaps a crop which included the whole head and less of his body would have been better.', '2006-04-13 03:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309298, 317376, 47597, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich colours. I think that the small size of this picture will mean that it will score lower than it should. The page makes a good central interest area - everybody in the pic is looking at it.</td>', 'Lovely rich colours. I think that the small size of this picture will mean that it will score lower than it should. The page makes a good central interest area - everybody in the pic is looking at it.', '2006-04-13 03:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309300, 318773, 47597, '<td valign="top">Blurry around the snails. The colours seem way too red/orange. I think that your lightsource was orangy and so if you had used white balance you would have got better colours.</td>', 'Blurry around the snails. The colours seem way too red/orange. I think that your lightsource was orangy and so if you had used white balance you would have got better colours.', '2006-04-13 03:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309306, 319978, 47597, '<td valign="top">There''s no "wow" in this pic for me. The only interest point in the pic is the photographer, but she is too small to make out any detail on.</td>', 'There''s no "wow" in this pic for me. The only interest point in the pic is the photographer, but she is too small to make out any detail on.', '2006-04-13 03:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309317, 317432, 47597, '<td valign="top">I like the desaturation, but I find the main subject quite uninteresting. No "wow" factor.</td>', 'I like the desaturation, but I find the main subject quite uninteresting. No "wow" factor.', '2006-04-13 03:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309319, 318500, 47597, '<td valign="top">The bright glowing parts of the guys shoe are quite distracting. The sepia was a good choice - making the scene warmer than a BW would have been.</td>', 'The bright glowing parts of the guys shoe are quite distracting. The sepia was a good choice - making the scene warmer than a BW would have been.', '2006-04-13 03:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309330, 318050, 47597, '<td valign="top">I suppose that this is deliberate, but the low contrast and blur in the pic just doesn''t appeal to me. Also, the crop has cut off part of both of the girls hands, which distracts me.</td>', 'I suppose that this is deliberate, but the low contrast and blur in the pic just doesn''t appeal to me. Also, the crop has cut off part of both of the girls hands, which distracts me.', '2006-04-13 03:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309334, 318840, 47597, '<td valign="top">Lovely tree and sky and scene. The glass building in the background seems out of place in what would otherwise be a pretty restful picture.</td>', 'Lovely tree and sky and scene. The glass building in the background seems out of place in what would otherwise be a pretty restful picture.', '2006-04-13 03:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309337, 319882, 47597, '<td valign="top">Nice interesting subject. The strong lighting (which unfortunately looks too artificial) causes strong shadows on his body and some bright hot spots on the masks behind.</td>', 'Nice interesting subject. The strong lighting (which unfortunately looks too artificial) causes strong shadows on his body and some bright hot spots on the masks behind.', '2006-04-13 03:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309339, 319579, 47597, '<td valign="top">The subjects are sitting in the shade but the grass behind them is in full sun. This makes the background brighter than the subject.</td>', 'The subjects are sitting in the shade but the grass behind them is in full sun. This makes the background brighter than the subject.', '2006-04-13 03:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309351, 319215, 41931, '<td valign="top">vomit.</td>', 'vomit.', '2006-04-13 04:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309358, 319810, 49155, '<td valign="top">A stunning photo but surely not Basic Editing! If you have not used dodge and burn please let me know and I will up your score.</td>', 'A stunning photo but surely not Basic Editing! If you have not used dodge and burn please let me know and I will up your score.', '2006-04-13 04:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309395, 319808, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is fun - I like that you''ve got so close, gives some impact. It would have been nice not to have lost the highlights, particularly on mother''s face - see where you can''t see the arm of her glasses? It''s often helpful to under-expose as a default setting to avoid those things.</td>', 'This is fun - I like that you''ve got so close, gives some impact. It would have been nice not to have lost the highlights, particularly on mother''s face - see where you can''t see the arm of her glasses? It''s often helpful to under-expose as a default setting to avoid those things.', '2006-04-13 05:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309396, 319117, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice work - love the texture of this, which is so often missing about moon photos.</td>', 'Nice work - love the texture of this, which is so often missing about moon photos.', '2006-04-13 05:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309424, 319581, 11960, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot -- NOT a fan of the border.</td>', 'Really cool shot -- NOT a fan of the border.', '2006-04-13 06:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309428, 318306, 11960, '<td valign="top">Missed focus. Or, if you meant to focus on the twigs in the FG, it''s distracting to me.</td>', 'Missed focus. Or, if you meant to focus on the twigs in the FG, it''s distracting to me.', '2006-04-13 06:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309436, 319215, 56243, '<td valign="top">This gave me a litle trouble.  When I first saw it I thought low because it made me angry, then i thought it''s doing it''s job.  It''s a photograph of a moment to incite emotion.  I conciously mark it down because of it''s content.  Simply because i don''t agree with it doesn''t mean it''s a bad picture.  However, I also don''t know what is truely going on.  It''s a great shot in the whole, but we can''t figure anything out about the story.  All we have is our first impression, which I can tell you for me wasn''t a good one.  If it only had a little more to help tell the story.</td>', 'This gave me a litle trouble.  When I first saw it I thought low because it made me angry, then i thought it''s doing it''s job.  It''s a photograph of a moment to incite emotion.  I conciously mark it down because of it''s content.  Simply because i don''t agree with it doesn''t mean it''s a bad picture.  However, I also don''t know what is truely going on.  It''s a great shot in the whole, but we can''t figure anything out about the story.  All we have is our first impression, which I can tell you for me wasn''t a good one.  If it only had a little more to help tell the story.', '2006-04-13 06:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309439, 319695, 56243, '<td valign="top">She is very pretty and the idea is great, but it looks more like a portrait than a candid</td>', 'She is very pretty and the idea is great, but it looks more like a portrait than a candid', '2006-04-13 06:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
