(2309738, 319816, 6999, '<td valign="top">The processing, particularly the halos from sharpening, are a problem here, and the image simply isn''t spectacular enough to overcome that.</td>', 'The processing, particularly the halos from sharpening, are a problem here, and the image simply isn''t spectacular enough to overcome that.', '2006-04-13 10:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309739, 319694, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken and nicely detailed; rather, er, ''standard'' subject doesn''t help it amongst so many oother child shots.</td>', 'Nicely taken and nicely detailed; rather, er, ''standard'' subject doesn''t help it amongst so many oother child shots.', '2006-04-13 10:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309740, 319581, 42100, '<td valign="top">Catching this guy in jovial moment really makes this photo.  Like the treatment as well.  Very nice!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-19 00:18:09.</i></td>', 'Catching this guy in jovial moment really makes this photo.  Like the treatment as well.  Very nice!', '2006-04-13 10:48:07.000000', '2006-04-19 01:18:09.000000', 1),
(2309742, 319562, 6999, '<td valign="top">Actually I would categorize this as the diametric opposite of your title - he seems intent and serious beyond his years to me. Nice portrait, but it lacks the candid feel, regardless of the actuality of the situation.</td>', 'Actually I would categorize this as the diametric opposite of your title - he seems intent and serious beyond his years to me. Nice portrait, but it lacks the candid feel, regardless of the actuality of the situation.', '2006-04-13 10:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309743, 316958, 42100, '<td valign="top">The rays of light in the mist and the bright splashes of color are stunning.  Amazing photograph!</td>', 'The rays of light in the mist and the bright splashes of color are stunning.  Amazing photograph!', '2006-04-13 10:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309750, 319331, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice work - great detail, dynamic, processing. My only gripe would be that there is no interaction of the people here - no-one seems to have contact with anyone else: the four primary characters seem to be in their own world. Still, as I said, nice work.</td>', 'Nice work - great detail, dynamic, processing. My only gripe would be that there is no interaction of the people here - no-one seems to have contact with anyone else: the four primary characters seem to be in their own world. Still, as I said, nice work.', '2006-04-13 10:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309753, 317746, 42100, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph, this ladies character seems to of served you well on more than one occasion.  Another masterpiece!</td>', 'Stunning photograph, this ladies character seems to of served you well on more than one occasion.  Another masterpiece!', '2006-04-13 10:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309755, 318665, 49773, '<td valign="top">extra!!!</td>', 'extra!!!', '2006-04-13 10:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309757, 319934, 49773, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture</td>', 'Amazing capture', '2006-04-13 10:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309758, 318826, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is something like the fourth image with this particular de-sat trick - leaving the blues and the purples. It''s making me think that there''s a problem with my monitor. I don''t get it, actually - don''t see the point, don''t see what the re-emphasising of those particular colours brings to the image, and in fact it seems more like a distraction.</td>', 'This is something like the fourth image with this particular de-sat trick - leaving the blues and the purples. It''s making me think that there''s a problem with my monitor. I don''t get it, actually - don''t see the point, don''t see what the re-emphasising of those particular colours brings to the image, and in fact it seems more like a distraction.', '2006-04-13 10:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309760, 319002, 49773, '<td valign="top">Wonderful but you should''ve cropped out the green/red thing on the left...</td>', 'Wonderful but you should''ve cropped out the green/red thing on the left...', '2006-04-13 10:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309762, 318637, 6999, '<td valign="top">What I like here most is the shadow of that nearest bird: I think a b/w treatment might have helped to bring out such things more strongly - colour here doesn''t serve the moment that well.</td>', 'What I like here most is the shadow of that nearest bird: I think a b/w treatment might have helped to bring out such things more strongly - colour here doesn''t serve the moment that well.', '2006-04-13 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309763, 317385, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great face ...</td>', 'Great face ...', '2006-04-13 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309764, 319207, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strange title for a difficult and quite painful image: there is little sense of rest here. I like it very much - the astringent lines of the composition work very effectively with his apparent disorganisation.</td>', 'Strange title for a difficult and quite painful image: there is little sense of rest here. I like it very much - the astringent lines of the composition work very effectively with his apparent disorganisation.', '2006-04-13 10:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309774, 318095, 33181, '<td valign="top">There is something about the texture of the faces that bothers me... looks like too much neat image or something</td>', 'There is something about the texture of the faces that bothers me... looks like too much neat image or something', '2006-04-13 11:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309776, 319658, 33181, '<td valign="top">Could be a nice image but the presentation is too small for this forum</td>', 'Could be a nice image but the presentation is too small for this forum', '2006-04-13 11:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309778, 317658, 33181, '<td valign="top">could be a good image but it is too small for this forum</td>', 'could be a good image but it is too small for this forum', '2006-04-13 11:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309779, 317474, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good light and good processing. I''m unsure that the very bright highlights in the trees and leaves doesn''t help the perception of the face - but i understand the desire to show the quality of the light.</td>', 'Good light and good processing. I''m unsure that the very bright highlights in the trees and leaves doesn''t help the perception of the face - but i understand the desire to show the quality of the light.', '2006-04-13 11:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309784, 317666, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice moment, and excellent technical stuff. Like the slightly daft pose, but I fear it might be lost amongst a raft of other child shots.</td>', 'Nice moment, and excellent technical stuff. Like the slightly daft pose, but I fear it might be lost amongst a raft of other child shots.', '2006-04-13 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309785, 320057, 33181, '<td valign="top">I like the capture but would like to have see critical focus somewhere... the DOF is good I dont mind that...It is just there is nothing that is tack on with the focus</td>', 'I like the capture but would like to have see critical focus somewhere... the DOF is good I dont mind that...It is just there is nothing that is tack on with the focus', '2006-04-13 11:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309787, 319391, 6999, '<td valign="top">Over-exposed, I think, and one would ideally prefer a touch more interaction in ones candids.</td>', 'Over-exposed, I think, and one would ideally prefer a touch more interaction in ones candids.', '2006-04-13 11:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309789, 320030, 33181, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot ... although the added "grain" is too regular that knocks it from a 8 to a 7 for me</td>', 'I like this a lot ... although the added "grain" is too regular that knocks it from a 8 to a 7 for me', '2006-04-13 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309793, 319101, 6999, '<td valign="top">Clever shooting, though the partial de-sat always provokes a sense of being patronised in me - I might actually have looked long enough to notice the ribbon, anyhow. It serves more point than in most such shots, obviously - and abviously the blue thing is relevant here, so I like the cleverness there.</td>', 'Clever shooting, though the partial de-sat always provokes a sense of being patronised in me - I might actually have looked long enough to notice the ribbon, anyhow. It serves more point than in most such shots, obviously - and abviously the blue thing is relevant here, so I like the cleverness there.', '2006-04-13 11:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309797, 317515, 6999, '<td valign="top">Colour temperature problems serve only to make this child look ill, to me. The flash exposure is unfortunate for the shaping and definition too.</td>', 'Colour temperature problems serve only to make this child look ill, to me. The flash exposure is unfortunate for the shaping and definition too.', '2006-04-13 11:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309800, 319562, 33181, '<td valign="top">I am going to err on your side on a little issue that I have with the focus on this image.  to me the focus point...on the eyes...is a little soft... I like the natural light from the big window. composition is good but I would have gone even more extreame on the crop (but that is just me) DOF and lens choice is good. 7.5 call it 8</td>', 'I am going to err on your side on a little issue that I have with the focus on this image.  to me the focus point...on the eyes...is a little soft... I like the natural light from the big window. composition is good but I would have gone even more extreame on the crop (but that is just me) DOF and lens choice is good. 7.5 call it 8', '2006-04-13 11:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309802, 319590, 20056, '<td valign="top">Too much noise reduction?</td>', 'Too much noise reduction?', '2006-04-13 11:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309804, 319728, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this - though the over-exposure of the side of the face is a pity - ina  shot with little enough visible, it''s a pity to lose that shaping and information.</td>', 'Like this - though the over-exposure of the side of the face is a pity - ina  shot with little enough visible, it''s a pity to lose that shaping and information.', '2006-04-13 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309807, 318733, 33181, '<td valign="top">This needs to pop.  Saturation is good but more contrast would have helped much.  a candid does not have to mean "unmodified" create...jazz it up a bit.<br/> <br/>I would also like to see the focal point of the image off of dead center.  Rule of thirds would be a player here</td>', 'This needs to pop.  Saturation is good but more contrast would have helped much.  a candid does not have to mean "unmodified" create...jazz it up a bit. I would also like to see the focal point of the image off of dead center.  Rule of thirds would be a player here', '2006-04-13 11:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309808, 319527, 8437, '<td valign="top">I would have zoomed in her a little bit more. Not a close-up, but just a little closer. I like the idea, and the moment captured, though.</td>', 'I would have zoomed in her a little bit more. Not a close-up, but just a little closer. I like the idea, and the moment captured, though.', '2006-04-13 11:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309810, 319535, 6999, '<td valign="top">Even if it were likely to get past the candid police (and I agree with the human thing), the overe-xposure and lack of depth to the colour of this would hurt your score anyhow I think. The reeds and twigs in front also cause problems - they aren''t thick enough to add a strong sense of location, in fact just look messy.</td>', 'Even if it were likely to get past the candid police (and I agree with the human thing), the overe-xposure and lack of depth to the colour of this would hurt your score anyhow I think. The reeds and twigs in front also cause problems - they aren''t thick enough to add a strong sense of location, in fact just look messy.', '2006-04-13 11:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309811, 318376, 20056, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not my idea of candid... but nice picture</td>', 'Sorry, not my idea of candid... but nice picture', '2006-04-13 11:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309812, 318918, 8437, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2006-04-13 11:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309817, 317416, 20056, '<td valign="top">VERY good, try bigger size next time.<br/>Background, DOF, and focus are perfect!... and look at the colors!</td>', 'VERY good, try bigger size next time.Background, DOF, and focus are perfect!... and look at the colors!', '2006-04-13 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309822, 318591, 6999, '<td valign="top">Despite the title, and a slight sense of this being overly blue in the colour temperature stakes, I really like the moment, your framing, and the dynamic. This is being so often missed in this challenge, which seems to be reverting to a simple portrait collection - the preciousness of the moment, the action, rather than the simple page of the face.</td>', 'Despite the title, and a slight sense of this being overly blue in the colour temperature stakes, I really like the moment, your framing, and the dynamic. This is being so often missed in this challenge, which seems to be reverting to a simple portrait collection - the preciousness of the moment, the action, rather than the simple page of the face.', '2006-04-13 11:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309824, 318421, 20056, '<td valign="top">bacground figures are more candid, specially the right one...</td>', 'bacground figures are more candid, specially the right one...', '2006-04-13 11:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309828, 319980, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the high contrast, but I think you''ve los a little control here slightly - those blown highlights on the arms and hands, and the extent of the shadow areas would have repaid a touch more control of processing I think.</td>', 'Like the high contrast, but I think you''ve los a little control here slightly - those blown highlights on the arms and hands, and the extent of the shadow areas would have repaid a touch more control of processing I think.', '2006-04-13 11:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309829, 319999, 33181, '<td valign="top">Great capture ... a lower angle would have made it even more dramatic ... like it a lot 7</td>', 'Great capture ... a lower angle would have made it even more dramatic ... like it a lot 7', '2006-04-13 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309830, 319973, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t see the connection to the challenge. ???  Concerning the image by itself it''s a little OOF.  Looks like a little camera blur.  Compositionally, the crop is too tight with not enough room for the head in the photo.  Need to give the subject some breathing room.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, don''t see the connection to the challenge. ???  Concerning the image by itself it''s a little OOF.  Looks like a little camera blur.  Compositionally, the crop is too tight with not enough room for the head in the photo.  Need to give the subject some breathing room.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-04-13 11:28:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2309832, 319999, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''s the chain-saw, isn''t it? The rest is oh so common these days, but that saw ...</td>', 'It''s the chain-saw, isn''t it? The rest is oh so common these days, but that saw ...', '2006-04-13 11:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309836, 318501, 20056, '<td valign="top">I hope she get well soon... trully candid picture</td>', 'I hope she get well soon... trully candid picture', '2006-04-13 11:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309839, 319486, 20056, '<td valign="top">Candid fight... good luck!<br/>good picture, did You try in B&amp;W?</td>', 'Candid fight... good luck!good picture, did You try in B&W?', '2006-04-13 11:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309840, 320008, 33181, '<td valign="top">this could have been brilliant..but over sharpened and too much NI skin looks plastic. no detail in the blacks on the jacket and his hair.  This image is generally over-processed</td>', 'this could have been brilliant..but over sharpened and too much NI skin looks plastic. no detail in the blacks on the jacket and his hair.  This image is generally over-processed', '2006-04-13 11:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309844, 319482, 20056, '<td valign="top">A little too busy but really candid, nice!</td>', 'A little too busy but really candid, nice!', '2006-04-13 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309847, 320014, 20056, '<td valign="top">Do You really know how good picture did You get? My first 10</td>', 'Do You really know how good picture did You get? My first 10', '2006-04-13 11:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309848, 319761, 33181, '<td valign="top">I got a chuckle on this when it came up so the impact of the image is good.  The expression on the kids face is good</td>', 'I got a chuckle on this when it came up so the impact of the image is good.  The expression on the kids face is good', '2006-04-13 11:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309849, 319562, 20056, '<td valign="top">Sorry, is it a portrait a candid moment? Nice picture</td>', 'Sorry, is it a portrait a candid moment? Nice picture', '2006-04-13 11:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309855, 319115, 20056, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be in the food to me... nice capture!</td>', 'The focus seems to be in the food to me... nice capture!', '2006-04-13 11:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309859, 319585, 8437, '<td valign="top">The picture is gorgeous, but I honestly see no candid in it.</td>', 'The picture is gorgeous, but I honestly see no candid in it.', '2006-04-13 11:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309860, 319336, 33181, '<td valign="top">great capture <br/>Good impact <br/>Good emotion</td>', 'great capture Good impact Good emotion', '2006-04-13 11:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309862, 319575, 6999, '<td valign="top">Marvellous stuff. Love the sense of location.</td>', 'Marvellous stuff. Love the sense of location.', '2006-04-13 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309866, 319636, 33181, '<td valign="top">color seems off to me bird is just about blown</td>', 'color seems off to me bird is just about blown', '2006-04-13 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309867, 318575, 20056, '<td valign="top">Did You ask permission to take the picture? :)</td>', 'Did You ask permission to take the picture? :)', '2006-04-13 11:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309875, 319587, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting candid.  Nice DOF to isolate the subject yet see enough background to hold the viewers interest.  His legs and torso form a sort of leading lines into the image (I know it wasn''t planned, but it works.).  I like how you can see the heat from the match/lighter he''s using to light his cig.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting candid.  Nice DOF to isolate the subject yet see enough background to hold the viewers interest.  His legs and torso form a sort of leading lines into the image (I know it wasn''t planned, but it works.).  I like how you can see the heat from the match/lighter he''s using to light his cig.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-13 11:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309876, 318248, 30049, '<td valign="top">You found a fun carefree moment to capture for this candid shot.  I like what you''ve done but wish that it wasn''t blurred.  Looks like some camera shake/movement?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You found a fun carefree moment to capture for this candid shot.  I like what you''ve done but wish that it wasn''t blurred.  Looks like some camera shake/movement?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-13 11:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309877, 319118, 8437, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous composition! My favorite in this challenge!</td>', 'Gorgeous composition! My favorite in this challenge!', '2006-04-13 11:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309879, 317746, 8437, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. One of my favorites.', '2006-04-13 11:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309882, 318381, 30049, '<td valign="top">If this is a true candid (meaning not setup), it''s a wonderful capture of a funny moment.  Worthy of being in a frame in your home somewhere.  If you did set this up - kudo''s for putting all of the elements together to compose a very nice image.  Great job, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'If this is a true candid (meaning not setup), it''s a wonderful capture of a funny moment.  Worthy of being in a frame in your home somewhere.  If you did set this up - kudo''s for putting all of the elements together to compose a very nice image.  Great job, and good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-13 11:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309885, 320041, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo.  I personally don''t see how an animal shot can be candid, but nonetheless you did a good job in your composition and exposure of this image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo.  I personally don''t see how an animal shot can be candid, but nonetheless you did a good job in your composition and exposure of this image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-13 11:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309889, 319391, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t see the connection to the challenge. ???</td>', 'Sorry, don''t see the connection to the challenge. ???', '2006-04-13 11:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309891, 318058, 8437, '<td valign="top">Awesome expression!</td>', 'Awesome expression!', '2006-04-13 11:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309892, 318593, 32767, '<td valign="top">There''s not enough information in the image to match the title. I have no idea what''s gonna be alright....or what is wrong. Good luck...nicely taken shot regardless.</td>', 'There''s not enough information in the image to match the title. I have no idea what''s gonna be alright....or what is wrong. Good luck...nicely taken shot regardless.', '2006-04-13 11:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309893, 319760, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  You''ve done a nice job of capturing a moment here.  Nice crisp detail and the B/W treatment is a wonderful choice.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  You''ve done a nice job of capturing a moment here.  Nice crisp detail and the B/W treatment is a wonderful choice.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-13 11:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309894, 317890, 8437, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Is (s)he in front of a glass? It looks like reflection of some kind, and it bothers me a little. Otherwise, the rest of the picture looks great!</td>', 'Very cute. Is (s)he in front of a glass? It looks like reflection of some kind, and it bothers me a little. Otherwise, the rest of the picture looks great!', '2006-04-13 11:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309899, 319871, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very well composed image with great use of natural lighting (I know, it''s all natural outside, but I guess the timing was right and you exposed well for it is what I''m saying.).  Critics will be hard pressed to find something that you "should have changed" on this one.  ;^)  Wait I know, the crop/framing is a bit tight at the bottom...needed to leave more room for the shoes.  Sorry, couldn''t resist.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very well composed image with great use of natural lighting (I know, it''s all natural outside, but I guess the timing was right and you exposed well for it is what I''m saying.).  Critics will be hard pressed to find something that you "should have changed" on this one.  ;^)  Wait I know, the crop/framing is a bit tight at the bottom...needed to leave more room for the shoes.  Sorry, couldn''t resist.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-13 12:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309900, 318915, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t see the connection to the challenge. ???</td>', 'Sorry, don''t see the connection to the challenge. ???', '2006-04-13 12:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309907, 317510, 20056, '<td valign="top">Very good catch!</td>', 'Very good catch!', '2006-04-13 12:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309911, 319227, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t see the connection to the challenge. ???  I like the way the border collie is tucked away at the top of the image.</td>', 'Sorry, don''t see the connection to the challenge. ???  I like the way the border collie is tucked away at the top of the image.', '2006-04-13 12:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309915, 320055, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun shot.  It''s a little grainy in the dark tones and might be a bit flat.  Did you try boosting the contrast a little, maybe play with levels a touch to clean up the blacks?  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a fun shot.  It''s a little grainy in the dark tones and might be a bit flat.  Did you try boosting the contrast a little, maybe play with levels a touch to clean up the blacks?  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-04-13 12:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309929, 317705, 48339, '<td valign="top">voting on this candid thing is difficult.  this is a great shot, without the title you can still feel the tough life of the man and it has a good candid feel, although he is looking at you his look is preoccupied by what he is doing. i''m sure you had a shot of him looking away, but chose this instead.. good luck. 8</td>', 'voting on this candid thing is difficult.  this is a great shot, without the title you can still feel the tough life of the man and it has a good candid feel, although he is looking at you his look is preoccupied by what he is doing. i''m sure you had a shot of him looking away, but chose this instead.. good luck. 8', '2006-04-13 12:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309933, 319101, 48339, '<td valign="top">never, ever, discuss, show, or title the ''ribbon''  needs to be put in the rule books.  good luck.</td>', 'never, ever, discuss, show, or title the ''ribbon''  needs to be put in the rule books.  good luck.', '2006-04-13 12:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309936, 320057, 48339, '<td valign="top">a little ''blown'' in a few places, distracts from image.  and the title makes me think, but i don''t get it.  doesn''t matter. solid 5</td>', 'a little ''blown'' in a few places, distracts from image.  and the title makes me think, but i don''t get it.  doesn''t matter. solid 5', '2006-04-13 12:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309937, 319793, 48339, '<td valign="top">washed out.</td>', 'washed out.', '2006-04-13 12:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
