(2310081, 319695, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is cute, but it is awfully small and looks more like a portfolio (full length) portrait than what I would consider an candid. For beauty of the photo, I give it a 4.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is cute, but it is awfully small and looks more like a portfolio (full length) portrait than what I would consider an candid. For beauty of the photo, I give it a 4.', '2006-04-13 13:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
