(2310083, 319907, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are far too easy targets for candids, and especially at events when you are expected to be there with camera are they pretty easy to get. No one really goes out of a comfort zone to get them. So, for me, although this is a candid, it is really not to my expectations of what I enjoy to see in a candid. It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Children are far too easy targets for candids, and especially at events when you are expected to be there with camera are they pretty easy to get. No one really goes out of a comfort zone to get them. So, for me, although this is a candid, it is really not to my expectations of what I enjoy to see in a candid. It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-13 13:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
