(2310088, 319876, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is ok. Very out of focus, but a decent amount of emotion showing from this unawares man. He could be just scratching his eye, but it looks as if he is depressed. So it good in that regard. The crop is not that good. Technically not a good photo. So its a 4 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is ok. Very out of focus, but a decent amount of emotion showing from this unawares man. He could be just scratching his eye, but it looks as if he is depressed. So it good in that regard. The crop is not that good. Technically not a good photo. So its a 4 for me.', '2006-04-13 13:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310092, 317225, 48339, '<td valign="top">not my style, but great job. 8</td>', 'not my style, but great job. 8', '2006-04-13 13:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310095, 319064, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are far too easily captured in candids.  They don''t hold back emotion and at any given moment they can give a candid photographer something to shoot. Not really out of the comfort zone enough for me here. It''s just ok, but not really up to my standard of a candid. I give it a 4.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Children are far too easily captured in candids.  They don''t hold back emotion and at any given moment they can give a candid photographer something to shoot. Not really out of the comfort zone enough for me here. It''s just ok, but not really up to my standard of a candid. I give it a 4.', '2006-04-13 13:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
