(2310103, 318434, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is ok. I like the tones, but it holds little interest for me otherwise. Hats and glasses are a nightmare for the candid photographer and mask any emotion that could normally be seen without them.  Here I just see a woman looking to the right or her left. I really don''t see anything that makes gives me much interest.  It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is ok. I like the tones, but it holds little interest for me otherwise. Hats and glasses are a nightmare for the candid photographer and mask any emotion that could normally be seen without them.  Here I just see a woman looking to the right or her left. I really don''t see anything that makes gives me much interest.  It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-13 13:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
