(2310293, 319508, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is ok. Not a whole lot of interest for my liking in a candid, but its just ok. I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary.  Focus is good. But it''s just a 4 for me as a candid.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is ok. Not a whole lot of interest for my liking in a candid, but its just ok. I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary.  Focus is good. But it''s just a 4 for me as a candid.', '2006-04-13 15:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310295, 319859, 13759, '<td valign="top">The proper channel selection or curves adjustments left some strange texture at floor.</td>', 'The proper channel selection or curves adjustments left some strange texture at floor.', '2006-04-13 15:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310297, 319985, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Well, I have to tell you I do not like this shot and would have reshot it from another angle. I think the words on the shoulder are quite vulgar and shock value will not gain points by me.  However, I do like that the guy is actually drawing and doing someting besides just sitting there. The tones are good. Focus is nice. Too bad about the words though. I give it a 4.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Well, I have to tell you I do not like this shot and would have reshot it from another angle. I think the words on the shoulder are quite vulgar and shock value will not gain points by me.  However, I do like that the guy is actually drawing and doing someting besides just sitting there. The tones are good. Focus is nice. Too bad about the words though. I give it a 4.', '2006-04-13 15:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310299, 317660, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene from another time.</td>', 'Looks like a scene from another time.', '2006-04-13 15:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310300, 319994, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>The man''s face looks like it has some nice character to it, but unfortunately this shot is way too out of focus to tell. It''s just an ok candid for me. It has a story to it, and does spark some interest, but the photo needed some serious work in USM and HMS.  It''s a 4 from me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. The man''s face looks like it has some nice character to it, but unfortunately this shot is way too out of focus to tell. It''s just an ok candid for me. It has a story to it, and does spark some interest, but the photo needed some serious work in USM and HMS.  It''s a 4 from me.', '2006-04-13 15:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310302, 318802, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Two children, very cute, but not all that interesting for me as a candid entry. I like to see something a bit more extra ordinary. Children are too easy for candids, and they have to be really out of the ordinary for me to see them as good candid contendors. Here I see little interest. Nice techs, but not a very good candid entry for me. It''s a 4 for techs though.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Two children, very cute, but not all that interesting for me as a candid entry. I like to see something a bit more extra ordinary. Children are too easy for candids, and they have to be really out of the ordinary for me to see them as good candid contendors. Here I see little interest. Nice techs, but not a very good candid entry for me. It''s a 4 for techs though.', '2006-04-13 15:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310305, 318104, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Interesting street, but not a very interesting candid. I really get nothing from this by way of interest. No story, no "kick", no spark to the mind. Just a guy walking down the street. It''s ok, but not my idea of a good candid. It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Interesting street, but not a very interesting candid. I really get nothing from this by way of interest. No story, no "kick", no spark to the mind. Just a guy walking down the street. It''s ok, but not my idea of a good candid. It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-13 15:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310309, 319999, 50961, '<td valign="top">I love it! So perfect..but my train of thought is different than others. I think this is a fun, humorous and candid shot.</td>', 'I love it! So perfect..but my train of thought is different than others. I think this is a fun, humorous and candid shot.', '2006-04-13 15:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310311, 318580, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>It''s ok as a stop action shot. It''s a bit too dark though, and then again too bright where the light does hit.  Children are also far too easy for candids, yet I can see no real emotion exuding from them because it is shot from behind.  Even had it been from the front, I would have had a hard time giving this more than a 3.  I look for something a bit more extra ordinary then this in a candid.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. It''s ok as a stop action shot. It''s a bit too dark though, and then again too bright where the light does hit.  Children are also far too easy for candids, yet I can see no real emotion exuding from them because it is shot from behind.  Even had it been from the front, I would have had a hard time giving this more than a 3.  I look for something a bit more extra ordinary then this in a candid.', '2006-04-13 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310312, 319335, 50961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love everything about it!</td>', 'Beautiful! Love everything about it!', '2006-04-13 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
