(2310316, 319930, 13759, '<td valign="top">Some not pretty noise, very blured to the aparent lighting conditions. Turn up your shutter speed and use noise shaper software like NoiseNija or NeatImage.</td>', 'Some not pretty noise, very blured to the aparent lighting conditions. Turn up your shutter speed and use noise shaper software like NoiseNija or NeatImage.', '2006-04-13 15:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310317, 317542, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>To me this is a very cute snapshot of a girl on a beach. As a candid, and it is, it is just too easy and not really extra ordinary. Someone one can see and photograph any day on the beach.  It''s cute, but not a great candid. I look for something a bit more out of ones comfort zone in a candid. A 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. To me this is a very cute snapshot of a girl on a beach. As a candid, and it is, it is just too easy and not really extra ordinary. Someone one can see and photograph any day on the beach.  It''s cute, but not a great candid. I look for something a bit more out of ones comfort zone in a candid. A 3 for me.', '2006-04-13 15:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310318, 318637, 50961, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! Love the real expression of agnst, inconvenience, and irritation on her face. Nicely done!</td>', 'Excellent capture! Love the real expression of agnst, inconvenience, and irritation on her face. Nicely done!', '2006-04-13 15:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
