(2310660, 319333, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the crop here.  Cutting off her head makes the hands that much more important - excellent choice.  Composition well done.  Wish the hand was a little brighter - I know that''s impossible with basic editing.  Colors good. Image clear. 7</td>', 'I like the crop here.  Cutting off her head makes the hands that much more important - excellent choice.  Composition well done.  Wish the hand was a little brighter - I know that''s impossible with basic editing.  Colors good. Image clear. 7', '2006-04-13 18:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310661, 319760, 56756, '<td valign="top">I love black and white photos and this is beautiful!  So clear and natural.</td>', 'I love black and white photos and this is beautiful!  So clear and natural.', '2006-04-13 18:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310665, 317548, 34192, '<td valign="top">subject is sharp, image composed well.  Honestly, its not giving me much of interest to dwell on. A well taken image and a good candid but short of what I would consider a great candid. 6</td>', 'subject is sharp, image composed well.  Honestly, its not giving me much of interest to dwell on. A well taken image and a good candid but short of what I would consider a great candid. 6', '2006-04-13 18:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
