(2310672, 319980, 34192, '<td valign="top">This one intrigues me and I think its the darks and the lights that keep me coming back.  Its just an ordinary moment but the subject owns this moment and this image (make sense?)  You see the conversation going on behind her and you''re tempted, but its more important to know what she''s reading.  The hands are very graceful, in opposition to the other women.  Anyway, 9</td>', 'This one intrigues me and I think its the darks and the lights that keep me coming back.  Its just an ordinary moment but the subject owns this moment and this image (make sense?)  You see the conversation going on behind her and you''re tempted, but its more important to know what she''s reading.  The hands are very graceful, in opposition to the other women.  Anyway, 9', '2006-04-13 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310676, 319871, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think I know his story too well. :)  Colors very well done.  Composition excellent.  DOF works, POV perfect for image. 8</td>', 'Interesting.  I think I know his story too well. :)  Colors very well done.  Composition excellent.  DOF works, POV perfect for image. 8', '2006-04-13 18:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
