(2310679, 319824, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really miss that foot.  Wish the POV was just a little lower.  Excellent color and clarity. 6</td>', 'I really miss that foot.  Wish the POV was just a little lower.  Excellent color and clarity. 6', '2006-04-13 18:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
