(2311396, 317746, 47117, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>A very good character face to have captured.  Nice use of HMS to bring that out. I don''t like the pink tones in the wig though, but a good (7) photo nonetheless.  A 7 is one of my highest scores given from what I have seen entered.<br/> <br/>I want to add, since the Texture Challenge results have been posted, that this looks like Erlinda, from librodo''s Texture win (congrats by the way, as I didn''t want to mention that in your comments before voting here).  I am sure this is the same woman. I am happy you got off 70 shots of her, but in the other explantion you said "she allowed you" to take her photo. In that, I don''t find this to be as candid as I assumed. It also kind of gives up anon for me.  I will have to deduct a bit for that from the original score I gave you. I really am a stickler for anon entries. Still a wonderful face though and does have great character.</td>', 'I don''t usually like comments or give them, but since candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to comment on every photo in this challenge. A very good character face to have captured.  Nice use of HMS to bring that out. I don''t like the pink tones in the wig though, but a good (7) photo nonetheless.  A 7 is one of my highest scores given from what I have seen entered. I want to add, since the Texture Challenge results have been posted, that this looks like Erlinda, from librodo''s Texture win (congrats by the way, as I didn''t want to mention that in your comments before voting here).  I am sure this is the same woman. I am happy you got off 70 shots of her, but in the other explantion you said "she allowed you" to take her photo. In that, I don''t find this to be as candid as I assumed. It also kind of gives up anon for me.  I will have to deduct a bit for that from the original score I gave you. I really am a stickler for anon entries. Still a wonderful face though and does have great character.', '2006-04-14 01:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
