(2312200, 319060, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition for emotive title and subject.  But your artsy poster-effect processing has removed too much detail, and lack of detail usually lowers scores at DPC.</td>', 'Nice composition for emotive title and subject.  But your artsy poster-effect processing has removed too much detail, and lack of detail usually lowers scores at DPC.', '2006-04-14 11:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312205, 318197, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, duotone.  Unfortunately, the image suffers from lack of sharpness, at least something should be sharp and detailed in the image, preferrably both the flower since it is dominant in the foreground and also couple in the background as they are your subject from the title.  Since they are in motion, this could be difficult -- crank up ISO if possible and stop down for DOF</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, duotone.  Unfortunately, the image suffers from lack of sharpness, at least something should be sharp and detailed in the image, preferrably both the flower since it is dominant in the foreground and also couple in the background as they are your subject from the title.  Since they are in motion, this could be difficult -- crank up ISO if possible and stop down for DOF', '2006-04-14 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
