(2312529, 319635, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I''m not usually much for shots of photographers by other photographers. They have to be doing something really out of the ordinary for me to really like it as a candid. This is a bit out of focus, but at least I do see something going on from the expression. It''a 4 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. I''m not usually much for shots of photographers by other photographers. They have to be doing something really out of the ordinary for me to really like it as a candid. This is a bit out of focus, but at least I do see something going on from the expression. It''a 4 for me.', '2006-04-14 14:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312530, 319954, 50945, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I like a dog pic.</td>', 'I can''t believe I like a dog pic.', '2006-04-14 14:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312532, 319880, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I don''t see much candid going on here. Looks like a shot taken at the prom where the girls are just posing for another camera other than your own. They are quite posed and the shot is quite expected at such events. I prefer to see something a bit more out of the ordinary in a candid. It''a s 4 for me.  Good focus and dof though, and I do like the tones.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. I don''t see much candid going on here. Looks like a shot taken at the prom where the girls are just posing for another camera other than your own. They are quite posed and the shot is quite expected at such events. I prefer to see something a bit more out of the ordinary in a candid. It''a s 4 for me.  Good focus and dof though, and I do like the tones.', '2006-04-14 14:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312534, 319486, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Looks like quite a lot of rallies were going on this past week? LOL..Ok, well, this one is quite out of focus.  The little boy is the only real person in focus, yet I am really not seeing this with much interest. I''m afraid it is a 4 for me.  I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary for my liking in a candid, and this is more of a shot expected to be seen at such events.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Looks like quite a lot of rallies were going on this past week? LOL..Ok, well, this one is quite out of focus.  The little boy is the only real person in focus, yet I am really not seeing this with much interest. I''m afraid it is a 4 for me.  I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary for my liking in a candid, and this is more of a shot expected to be seen at such events.', '2006-04-14 14:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312536, 318713, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is ok, but I have some problems with it as a candid.  A man counting money isn''t really what I care to see in a candid. No, he isn''t posing for the camera or anything, but I do see little to no interest in the shot for me. No real story, or anything out really of the ordinary or different for my view.  It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is ok, but I have some problems with it as a candid.  A man counting money isn''t really what I care to see in a candid. No, he isn''t posing for the camera or anything, but I do see little to no interest in the shot for me. No real story, or anything out really of the ordinary or different for my view.  It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-14 15:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312540, 318248, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Children are prime targets for candids. One never really has to leave their comfort zone to take one of them at any given time because children''s emotions are really uncontained.  This is cute, but it''s out of focus and not very well composed. I''m afraid it holds very little interest for me as a candid. I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary, or different. It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Children are prime targets for candids. One never really has to leave their comfort zone to take one of them at any given time because children''s emotions are really uncontained.  This is cute, but it''s out of focus and not very well composed. I''m afraid it holds very little interest for me as a candid. I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary, or different. It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-14 15:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312542, 318058, 50945, '<td valign="top">A worthy 10. Great job!</td>', 'A worthy 10. Great job!', '2006-04-14 15:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312546, 317743, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I love the tones on this image, however, I don''t see much here for my particular taste in a candid. Children are far too easy targets for candids as they tend to have their emotions and actions be uncontained. It''s a lot harder to capture a moment of an adult. It''s a cute photo, but for a candid an for my taste, I prefer to see something a bit more out of the ordinary. It''s a 4 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. I love the tones on this image, however, I don''t see much here for my particular taste in a candid. Children are far too easy targets for candids as they tend to have their emotions and actions be uncontained. It''s a lot harder to capture a moment of an adult. It''s a cute photo, but for a candid an for my taste, I prefer to see something a bit more out of the ordinary. It''s a 4 for me.', '2006-04-14 15:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312548, 317515, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is a cute snapshot, but not what I look for particularly in a candid.  Children''s emotions and actions are virtually uncontained. They are easy and prime targets for candids.  I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary. As for technicals, I believe there is good focus here, but the lighting looks blue, as if it were set for incondescent lighting indoors.  It badly needed some tonal adjustments. I would have converted it to b/w and given some attention to HMS. It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is a cute snapshot, but not what I look for particularly in a candid.  Children''s emotions and actions are virtually uncontained. They are easy and prime targets for candids.  I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary. As for technicals, I believe there is good focus here, but the lighting looks blue, as if it were set for incondescent lighting indoors.  It badly needed some tonal adjustments. I would have converted it to b/w and given some attention to HMS. It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-14 15:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312553, 318381, 50945, '<td valign="top">One of the three 10 I rated out of 397 so far. Great expression, framing. I love the adult gloves. All that protection and a sudden wind gust unravels all. Well done1</td>', 'One of the three 10 I rated out of 397 so far. Great expression, framing. I love the adult gloves. All that protection and a sudden wind gust unravels all. Well done1', '2006-04-14 15:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312554, 317660, 50945, '<td valign="top">Classic stuff! The boy''s expression makes this a winner.</td>', 'Classic stuff! The boy''s expression makes this a winner.', '2006-04-14 15:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312555, 319793, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is a color portrait/headshot, and not a candid shot. Children are far too easy to capture, in candids or any other type of shot. Their emotions and actions are virtually uncontained.  A candid, to me, and in what I like to see, and as I see it in photography and not based on Websters Dictionary, is a capture of a moment of someone unawares and that tells a bit of a story to the viewer. There is no real story here. A darling girl. Lovely eyes. But a straight on head shot and portrait. It''s a 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is a color portrait/headshot, and not a candid shot. Children are far too easy to capture, in candids or any other type of shot. Their emotions and actions are virtually uncontained.  A candid, to me, and in what I like to see, and as I see it in photography and not based on Websters Dictionary, is a capture of a moment of someone unawares and that tells a bit of a story to the viewer. There is no real story here. A darling girl. Lovely eyes. But a straight on head shot and portrait. It''s a 3 for me.', '2006-04-14 15:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312573, 319060, 49711, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry I just don''t get it. Am I afraid or is it fearful? Its a scary picture but I don''t know if its a shot of fear, or the reaper or just a decomposing skull in a blanket. Its interesting, all right, I think it would have been better if the eyes were more visible.</td>', 'I''m sorry I just don''t get it. Am I afraid or is it fearful? Its a scary picture but I don''t know if its a shot of fear, or the reaper or just a decomposing skull in a blanket. Its interesting, all right, I think it would have been better if the eyes were more visible.', '2006-04-14 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312588, 319333, 49450, '<td valign="top">She lookes posed</td>', 'She lookes posed', '2006-04-14 15:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312591, 319101, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, candids of animals are really not what I look for in a good candid. Animals are aware and both unaware at the same time of a photographer, nor do they care either way.  Too easy, no comfort zone lost. It''s a 2 for me. Nice tones though and love you didn''t desat the ribbon.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Unfortunately, candids of animals are really not what I look for in a good candid. Animals are aware and both unaware at the same time of a photographer, nor do they care either way.  Too easy, no comfort zone lost. It''s a 2 for me. Nice tones though and love you didn''t desat the ribbon.', '2006-04-14 15:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312593, 319919, 49450, '<td valign="top">Cute, but it looks posed.</td>', 'Cute, but it looks posed.', '2006-04-14 15:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312698, 317041, 57105, '<td valign="top">Hang on a sec... a candid pot? I must admit- you caught the pot in a natural pose that truly captures the spirit of the moment. My only critism is this- was this photo staged? I believe you put those pots into that pose! Nice Jugs!</td>', 'Hang on a sec... a candid pot? I must admit- you caught the pot in a natural pose that truly captures the spirit of the moment. My only critism is this- was this photo staged? I believe you put those pots into that pose! Nice Jugs!', '2006-04-14 16:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312720, 320019, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, subjects, colors.  Focus on person in foreground would be better and/or more DOF.</td>', 'Nice composition, subjects, colors.  Focus on person in foreground would be better and/or more DOF.', '2006-04-14 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312721, 320030, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a nice expression.  After conversion to B&amp;W, please revisit your levels.  Bumping up the midtone and black levels might help to pull her face out of the background.  Also DOF to include the guy might be better for many viewers because there is so much of him.</td>', 'Nice capture of a nice expression.  After conversion to B&W, please revisit your levels.  Bumping up the midtone and black levels might help to pull her face out of the background.  Also DOF to include the guy might be better for many viewers because there is so much of him.', '2006-04-14 16:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312740, 318380, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>EDITED:  This is an ok candid. Lots of shadows and lighting problems that may have been solved using software and within basic editing rules. It is a cute depiction of a couple though, and kind of tells a story. I give it a 5.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. EDITED:  This is an ok candid. Lots of shadows and lighting problems that may have been solved using software and within basic editing rules. It is a cute depiction of a couple though, and kind of tells a story. I give it a 5.', '2006-04-14 16:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312741, 319695, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks like a really cute shot, but I wish that it were bigger so that I could see more detail, please see <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a></td>', 'Looks like a really cute shot, but I wish that it were bigger so that I could see more detail, please see tutorial', '2006-04-14 16:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312746, 319575, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colors.  People are so far away that this is more of a landscape than a candid.  The positions are almost enough, but detail to see faces and expressions would be better for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition, colors.  People are so far away that this is more of a landscape than a candid.  The positions are almost enough, but detail to see faces and expressions would be better for this challenge.', '2006-04-14 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312756, 319977, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  For this challenge, I''d prefer more person and less architecture, crop-off top landscape-mode would be better.</td>', 'Nice composition.  For this challenge, I''d prefer more person and less architecture, crop-off top landscape-mode would be better.', '2006-04-14 16:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312774, 319618, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice moment.  Unfortunately looks back-focussed with sharp pipes, focus on face would be better.  Also consider cropping out right side to mirror.</td>', 'Nice moment.  Unfortunately looks back-focussed with sharp pipes, focus on face would be better.  Also consider cropping out right side to mirror.', '2006-04-14 17:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312777, 320004, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice eye contact.  Slightly tighter crop would be better, removing cropped-in-half person on right, some of trees above.  Bigger image would allow us to find more detail, please <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a>see</td>', 'Nice eye contact.  Slightly tighter crop would be better, removing cropped-in-half person on right, some of trees above.  Bigger image would allow us to find more detail, please tutorialsee', '2006-04-14 17:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312780, 319007, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice smile, wish for more exposure / brighter levels for face.</td>', 'Nice smile, wish for more exposure / brighter levels for face.', '2006-04-14 17:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312783, 319334, 46001, '<td valign="top">Just say no to crack dude!</td>', 'Just say no to crack dude!', '2006-04-14 17:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312844, 319485, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, expression, eyes.  I''d prefer more exposure / brighter levels, although I can guess that you may be trying to be faithful to the actual lighting.</td>', 'Cute shot, expression, eyes.  I''d prefer more exposure / brighter levels, although I can guess that you may be trying to be faithful to the actual lighting.', '2006-04-14 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312860, 319806, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, but where are their baseball gloves, makes me guess that this is more posed than candid?  Looks like too many managers, and they don''t visit the outfield, they make the outfielder walk to them ... :-)  Still cute.</td>', 'Cute shot, but where are their baseball gloves, makes me guess that this is more posed than candid?  Looks like too many managers, and they don''t visit the outfield, they make the outfielder walk to them ... :-)  Still cute.', '2006-04-14 18:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312862, 319590, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice candid moment.  The poles are unfortunate.  I think that a tighter crop without the legs and red shirt of the boy would be better.</td>', 'Nice candid moment.  The poles are unfortunate.  I think that a tighter crop without the legs and red shirt of the boy would be better.', '2006-04-14 18:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312868, 319926, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moment and expression.  Tighter crop removing some of left might be better.</td>', 'Nice capture of the moment and expression.  Tighter crop removing some of left might be better.', '2006-04-14 18:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312869, 319959, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, composition.  Slightly tighter crop might be better.  Interesting how the pool rail frame her head and upper body.</td>', 'Nice capture, composition.  Slightly tighter crop might be better.  Interesting how the pool rail frame her head and upper body.', '2006-04-14 18:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312870, 318953, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling.  The head is dead center vertically, maybe because you were trying for the colorful flowers?  There just to far away, I suggest forgetting them, that a tighter crop would be better with all of the attention on her.</td>', 'Nice feeling.  The head is dead center vertically, maybe because you were trying for the colorful flowers?  There just to far away, I suggest forgetting them, that a tighter crop would be better with all of the attention on her.', '2006-04-14 18:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312871, 317890, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The hair sticking up is just great.  Nice composition, sharpness, colors.</td>', 'Great shot.  The hair sticking up is just great.  Nice composition, sharpness, colors.', '2006-04-14 18:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312873, 318388, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice natural spotlight.  I think that a tighter crop would be better - loose the distracting sign on the left, put more pixels and detail into your subject.</td>', 'Nice natural spotlight.  I think that a tighter crop would be better - loose the distracting sign on the left, put more pixels and detail into your subject.', '2006-04-14 18:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312874, 318575, 3569, '<td valign="top">more like good buddies.</td>', 'more like good buddies.', '2006-04-14 18:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312892, 319208, 44490, '<td valign="top">Aha, looks like Lake Michigan, near North Ave.  Nice capture of action, brings back memories of playing volleyball at North Ave. and Oak St. years ago.  Nice composition, colors, stop action.</td>', 'Aha, looks like Lake Michigan, near North Ave.  Nice capture of action, brings back memories of playing volleyball at North Ave. and Oak St. years ago.  Nice composition, colors, stop action.', '2006-04-14 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312933, 319694, 48245, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this photo does better if the camera was at the same level as the child instead of looking down?</td>', 'I wonder if this photo does better if the camera was at the same level as the child instead of looking down?', '2006-04-14 18:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312935, 318575, 48245, '<td valign="top">okay... too much</td>', 'okay... too much', '2006-04-14 18:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312936, 319952, 48245, '<td valign="top">more of a tell... since the flop is on the table you would think he would already know what his hole cards where... ;-)</td>', 'more of a tell... since the flop is on the table you would think he would already know what his hole cards where... ;-)', '2006-04-14 18:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312937, 319876, 48245, '<td valign="top">this picture seems off balanced.</td>', 'this picture seems off balanced.', '2006-04-14 18:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312940, 319999, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Poor guy.  Great candid shot.  I just love hos miserable he looks.  Nice snap shot of the world we live in.</td>', 'Wow.  Poor guy.  Great candid shot.  I just love hos miserable he looks.  Nice snap shot of the world we live in.', '2006-04-14 18:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312944, 319519, 48245, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Pulling back a bit on this might help it some more.</td>', 'Nice shot. Pulling back a bit on this might help it some more.', '2006-04-14 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312946, 320025, 48245, '<td valign="top">there is no focus point???</td>', 'there is no focus point???', '2006-04-14 18:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312948, 316958, 48245, '<td valign="top">this is a neat shot!</td>', 'this is a neat shot!', '2006-04-14 18:48:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2312949, 316958, 3032, '<td valign="top">I love it how the colors stand out in the excellent misty light.</td>', 'I love it how the colors stand out in the excellent misty light.', '2006-04-14 18:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312952, 319382, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good composition and toning. Perfect dof with the fingers on the book in focus and the out of focus head --&gt; gives a feeling of ''thinking/learning/wisdom.</td>', 'Good composition and toning. Perfect dof with the fingers on the book in focus and the out of focus head --> gives a feeling of ''thinking/learning/wisdom.', '2006-04-14 18:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312958, 319207, 3032, '<td valign="top">Subtle. The irregularity of the human form in this composition with such defined straight lines (stones and light distribution) makes the human stand out very well. 10</td>', 'Subtle. The irregularity of the human form in this composition with such defined straight lines (stones and light distribution) makes the human stand out very well. 10', '2006-04-14 18:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312959, 319959, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it how the frame followes the line of the back and frames the head section. Nice B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like it how the frame followes the line of the back and frames the head section. Nice B&W.', '2006-04-14 19:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312962, 319891, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and toning. Backlight works well here, gives a nice line on the hair of the subjects. The out of focus person gives a good sence of place.</td>', 'Nice composition and toning. Backlight works well here, gives a nice line on the hair of the subjects. The out of focus person gives a good sence of place.', '2006-04-14 19:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312963, 319916, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool composition. The round flows of the human form stand out well in the straight lines of the architecture. The shadows add depth. Nice b&amp;w.</td>', 'Cool composition. The round flows of the human form stand out well in the straight lines of the architecture. The shadows add depth. Nice b&w.', '2006-04-14 19:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312966, 319980, 3032, '<td valign="top">When you just look at the arm and hands in this shot you''d think it is some kind of ballet. :) Great balance between light and dark here.<br/> <br/></td>', 'When you just look at the arm and hands in this shot you''d think it is some kind of ballet. :) Great balance between light and dark here. ', '2006-04-14 19:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312969, 318354, 3032, '<td valign="top">I love the unbalance in this. The left side is almost monocromatic in contrasty subtle lit brown tones while the right side is vibrant, saturated, and colorful. The texture of the dividing line is like a zipper. Cool shot.</td>', 'I love the unbalance in this. The left side is almost monocromatic in contrasty subtle lit brown tones while the right side is vibrant, saturated, and colorful. The texture of the dividing line is like a zipper. Cool shot.', '2006-04-14 19:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312972, 317873, 3032, '<td valign="top">Apart from the sky I love this shot of a Gamlastan street. Very nice b&amp;w.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Apart from the sky I love this shot of a Gamlastan street. Very nice b&w. ', '2006-04-14 19:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312976, 319700, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and toning of this. There are some strong lones and diaginals here. I also like it how the one on the poles is showing off and the one on the beach looks like she doesn''t care.</td>', 'I like the composition and toning of this. There are some strong lones and diaginals here. I also like it how the one on the poles is showing off and the one on the beach looks like she doesn''t care.', '2006-04-14 19:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312977, 319548, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great profile against a strong background. Great balance.</td>', 'Great profile against a strong background. Great balance.', '2006-04-14 19:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312978, 319295, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the motion of the hand. Nice documentary shot.</td>', 'I like the motion of the hand. Nice documentary shot.', '2006-04-14 19:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312980, 319494, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and lines, cool in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice perspective and lines, cool in b&w.', '2006-04-14 19:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312985, 318501, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good color portrait. The title matches the look in the eyes well.<br/>I wonder, the bald head yet a feminine face; chemo therapy?</td>', 'Good color portrait. The title matches the look in the eyes well.I wonder, the bald head yet a feminine face; chemo therapy?', '2006-04-14 19:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
