(2313833, 317705, 23394, '<td valign="top">there''s a lot of character in that face, and from what i can see of his attire, he appears to be involved in something interesting.  unfortunately, the way you''ve composed this shot, there''s not enough context to give me anything to go on.</td>', 'there''s a lot of character in that face, and from what i can see of his attire, he appears to be involved in something interesting.  unfortunately, the way you''ve composed this shot, there''s not enough context to give me anything to go on.', '2006-04-15 08:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
