(2313922, 318099, 56243, '<td valign="top">Sadly this is happening more and more. In our own city, we are even building another Hotel for the Homeless to house over a thousand people.   We are a fair sized city, but nothing the size of Seattle.  I hope other people see this and makes them think about their own areas.  <br/> <br/>On the voting side I want to let you know this isn''t a moral issue.  I''ve read a lot on that lately.  I''m voting a seven because of the contrast.  We can barely see his black suit, it''s blending too much.  I understand that it was taken at night, but is there anything that could''ve helped?  <br/> <br/>I''m sorry if you think I''m wrong, but I am only learning myself.  Perhaps this photo will become more than you know, by making people actually help people.</td>', 'Sadly this is happening more and more. In our own city, we are even building another Hotel for the Homeless to house over a thousand people.   We are a fair sized city, but nothing the size of Seattle.  I hope other people see this and makes them think about their own areas.   On the voting side I want to let you know this isn''t a moral issue.  I''ve read a lot on that lately.  I''m voting a seven because of the contrast.  We can barely see his black suit, it''s blending too much.  I understand that it was taken at night, but is there anything that could''ve helped?   I''m sorry if you think I''m wrong, but I am only learning myself.  Perhaps this photo will become more than you know, by making people actually help people.', '2006-04-15 09:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
