(2314952, 320004, 50142, '<td valign="top">You will propably get comments on the size of the image. Bit too small - use the 640 allowed. Nice shot - Not enough contrast. The blond is almost overshadowed by the brunette.</td>', 'You will propably get comments on the size of the image. Bit too small - use the 640 allowed. Nice shot - Not enough contrast. The blond is almost overshadowed by the brunette.', '2006-04-15 22:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
