(2314955, 319875, 50142, '<td valign="top">Look out for the smoke? LOL - Vivid colours. Some people might say it is posed. I will vote as if it is not posed. You get a 7</td>', 'Look out for the smoke? LOL - Vivid colours. Some people might say it is posed. I will vote as if it is not posed. You get a 7', '2006-04-15 22:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
