(2314998, 319926, 50142, '<td valign="top">LOL - What a nice Candid. Little guy seems to be at the end of his ropes due to this bird. Some advice - Next time - take the shot in RAW. You will get much more control over the White Balance. 6 from me.</td>', 'LOL - What a nice Candid. Little guy seems to be at the end of his ropes due to this bird. Some advice - Next time - take the shot in RAW. You will get much more control over the White Balance. 6 from me.', '2006-04-15 22:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
