(2315060, 319432, 50142, '<td valign="top">Being a man, I am a gr8 fan of shower shots. You most likely got plenty of comments about the yellow colour. Sharpen up the face, Get the yellow away (shoot in RAW and adjust colour tone) and I would''ve given you an 8. This one is a 4.</td>', 'Being a man, I am a gr8 fan of shower shots. You most likely got plenty of comments about the yellow colour. Sharpen up the face, Get the yellow away (shoot in RAW and adjust colour tone) and I would''ve given you an 8. This one is a 4.', '2006-04-15 22:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2315061, 319117, 50142, '<td valign="top">Nice moon shot, but IMO doesn''t fit the challenge. Sorry. Gr8 Shot though. I battle with my moon shots. PM me with your camera settings for this one.</td>', 'Nice moon shot, but IMO doesn''t fit the challenge. Sorry. Gr8 Shot though. I battle with my moon shots. PM me with your camera settings for this one.', '2006-04-15 22:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
