(2320104, 319952, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting set up, but I wish I could see more of the guys face.  Now there isn''t really anything to hold my attention for long, although he looks like quite a character.</td>', 'This is an interesting set up, but I wish I could see more of the guys face.  Now there isn''t really anything to hold my attention for long, although he looks like quite a character.', '2006-04-17 19:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320110, 319102, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  I think it meets the challenge well and gives off a lot of atmosphere.  I love the creepy cross!  I think you could have used just a tad more contrast here, you would have been able to maintain the foggy feeling but make it a little easier to see what is happening.  Gets a 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this image.  I think it meets the challenge well and gives off a lot of atmosphere.  I love the creepy cross!  I think you could have used just a tad more contrast here, you would have been able to maintain the foggy feeling but make it a little easier to see what is happening.  Gets a 10 from me.', '2006-04-17 19:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320113, 319761, 37103, '<td valign="top">This boy is making a pretty funny face, but something about his pose looks weird.  It almost looks like he is abou to fall over.  Maybe if you caught him a moment before or after this would be a more interesting shot.</td>', 'This boy is making a pretty funny face, but something about his pose looks weird.  It almost looks like he is abou to fall over.  Maybe if you caught him a moment before or after this would be a more interesting shot.', '2006-04-17 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320117, 319558, 37103, '<td valign="top">Great candid.  I love the shoe sitting off the side and the lottery sign.  All the details in this photo work well together and complement the idea adn the feeling that is being expressed.  Great job.</td>', 'Great candid.  I love the shoe sitting off the side and the lottery sign.  All the details in this photo work well together and complement the idea adn the feeling that is being expressed.  Great job.', '2006-04-17 19:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320165, 319641, 5728, '<td valign="top">Like the shot, candid for sure, maybe even more if he hadn''t been looking at you. The main subject is definitely separated from the background, good work on the exposure on this image. I know you can''t clone in basic, but the spots on the wall in the left do distract somewhat.</td>', 'Like the shot, candid for sure, maybe even more if he hadn''t been looking at you. The main subject is definitely separated from the background, good work on the exposure on this image. I know you can''t clone in basic, but the spots on the wall in the left do distract somewhat.', '2006-04-17 20:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320344, 319519, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, great tones and splendid candidness.</td>', 'Wonderful photo, great tones and splendid candidness.', '2006-04-17 21:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
