(2320514, 319760, 36382, '<td valign="top">Can''t stop coming back to this picture.  It''s like it was taken 30 years ago and feels really nostalgic to me.  Thanks.  I''ve really enjoyed it.  Hope it''s a winner.  From a technical aspect, I think the black and white treatment is excellent, too.</td>', 'Can''t stop coming back to this picture.  It''s like it was taken 30 years ago and feels really nostalgic to me.  Thanks.  I''ve really enjoyed it.  Hope it''s a winner.  From a technical aspect, I think the black and white treatment is excellent, too.', '2006-04-17 22:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
