(2320910, 320025, 30049, '<td valign="top">Too bad you aren''t about 6 inches taller.  ;^)  I take it the lady is the reporter?  You did a good job of composing this to get her face positioned as it is in the frame.  While this works I can''t help but want to see a little more of her.</td>', 'Too bad you aren''t about 6 inches taller.  ;^)  I take it the lady is the reporter?  You did a good job of composing this to get her face positioned as it is in the frame.  While this works I can''t help but want to see a little more of her.', '2006-04-18 01:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
