(2321136, 318086, 40912, '<td valign="top">The perspective on this is throwing me off. The two ..arms?... stretching out in front look like giant fingers holding the kid''s neck. :/</td>', 'The perspective on this is throwing me off. The two ..arms?... stretching out in front look like giant fingers holding the kid''s neck. :/', '2006-04-18 04:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
