(2321140, 320010, 40912, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s my bored kiddo. He probably looked like that ''cause you took away his camera. :D Seems wrong that you enter a pic of him before I do.. hmm.</td>', 'Yep, that''s my bored kiddo. He probably looked like that ''cause you took away his camera. :D Seems wrong that you enter a pic of him before I do.. hmm.', '2006-04-18 04:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321163, 319178, 42601, '<td valign="top">Wow, magnificent shot. I love the grain in this picture. It, together with the white border lends to the mood and feel of this capture. Shooting a true candid can probably have its limits in terms of timing and background, which is why I am assuming you chose this close crop. It works wonderfully though. Well done on a great shot.</td>', 'Wow, magnificent shot. I love the grain in this picture. It, together with the white border lends to the mood and feel of this capture. Shooting a true candid can probably have its limits in terms of timing and background, which is why I am assuming you chose this close crop. It works wonderfully though. Well done on a great shot.', '2006-04-18 05:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
