(2321229, 319335, 6999, '<td valign="top">A decent wildlife shot, though one would naturally presume its a zoo shot, which is let down by processing i think: colour temperature seems all wrong, colour saturation is almost non-existent and yet it hasn''t the feeling of being effectively de-saturated at all - just looks like it needs more work. Composition doesn''t do a lot for me - that rock image right and its closeness ot the female, the half0dead tree image left ...</td>', 'A decent wildlife shot, though one would naturally presume its a zoo shot, which is let down by processing i think: colour temperature seems all wrong, colour saturation is almost non-existent and yet it hasn''t the feeling of being effectively de-saturated at all - just looks like it needs more work. Composition doesn''t do a lot for me - that rock image right and its closeness ot the female, the half0dead tree image left ...', '2006-04-18 06:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
