(2322143, 319215, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>A very good high key image, but to me, not a candid. In photographing candids, I prefer to see something a bit more out of the ordinary, a comic situation, a story untold, etc. I can''t get emotion from this photo. All I see is white and what I can see of the eyes is masked. Also, for me; masks, glasses, and hats are a nightmare for the candid photographer.  Unfortunately, this would have faired well in a high key challenge, but not as a candid to me.  It''s a 2.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. A very good high key image, but to me, not a candid. In photographing candids, I prefer to see something a bit more out of the ordinary, a comic situation, a story untold, etc. I can''t get emotion from this photo. All I see is white and what I can see of the eyes is masked. Also, for me; masks, glasses, and hats are a nightmare for the candid photographer.  Unfortunately, this would have faired well in a high key challenge, but not as a candid to me.  It''s a 2.', '2006-04-18 15:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
