(2322248, 319889, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Photographers taking photos of other photographers usually makes for a good candid to me IF the photographer they are photographing is doing something out of the ordinary. In this shot, I see nothing really out of the ordinary.  I also find the tones and lighting and focus not to be the best. Just not a top pic for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Photographers taking photos of other photographers usually makes for a good candid to me IF the photographer they are photographing is doing something out of the ordinary. In this shot, I see nothing really out of the ordinary.  I also find the tones and lighting and focus not to be the best. Just not a top pic for me.', '2006-04-18 15:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322253, 319522, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is just ok for me. Children are far too easy though, to me anyway, to make for a good photographed candid. They don''t usually contain emotion or actions.  I do like them when they are doing something out of the ordinary or to the extreme, but in this case, this is a bit too ordinary for my liking. Cute child though!</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. This is just ok for me. Children are far too easy though, to me anyway, to make for a good photographed candid. They don''t usually contain emotion or actions.  I do like them when they are doing something out of the ordinary or to the extreme, but in this case, this is a bit too ordinary for my liking. Cute child though!', '2006-04-18 15:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322257, 319725, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>If I were to list this in categories, I would list it as a land or seascape and then as an emotive, but not as a candid. I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary in candids, and a bit closer up so I can get a feel for the persons thoughts.  This one has the person too far away and is a shot that can be seen on pretty much any beach side.  Technically, it is a bit noisy and the colors seem to be off. Not a top pic for me.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. If I were to list this in categories, I would list it as a land or seascape and then as an emotive, but not as a candid. I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary in candids, and a bit closer up so I can get a feel for the persons thoughts.  This one has the person too far away and is a shot that can be seen on pretty much any beach side.  Technically, it is a bit noisy and the colors seem to be off. Not a top pic for me.', '2006-04-18 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322263, 319944, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Not really a candid to me.  Seems to be hiding from the camera but then gets caught and laughs. I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary or that has a bit of a kick to it.  I do like the tones, and good dof on the face rather than the tree or the background.</td>', 'I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. Not really a candid to me.  Seems to be hiding from the camera but then gets caught and laughs. I like to see something a bit more out of the ordinary or that has a bit of a kick to it.  I do like the tones, and good dof on the face rather than the tree or the background.', '2006-04-18 15:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
