(2323953, 319760, 20462, '<td valign="top">E,<br/> <br/>You are my favorite.  You astonish me and inspire.  I can''t wait to get back to my modest city of Denver, so once more I can be around the goings-on of citylife.  However, England and its cities offer so much LIFE, activity and most of all character and you can capture it with expertise.  Your b/w treatment is tops, literally the best I have seen, period.</td>', 'E, You are my favorite.  You astonish me and inspire.  I can''t wait to get back to my modest city of Denver, so once more I can be around the goings-on of citylife.  However, England and its cities offer so much LIFE, activity and most of all character and you can capture it with expertise.  Your b/w treatment is tops, literally the best I have seen, period.', '2006-04-19 01:56:33.000000', NULL, 0),
