(2324353, 320008, 31133, '<td valign="top">Hey Shail :-) This has some really cool tones, so I think the b&amp;w part of your post-processing was a big hit - well done! I can''t believe how mean some people are with the comments. I agree that you went too far with the noise reduction and I would''ve made that comment had I voted on Candid. But I wish people would give criticism in a slightly less sarcastic way. Anyway, great job with the b&amp;w, super title, nice capture. Just for fun, maybe you could try reprocessing without the NI and see how it looks. The composition is brilliant.</td>', 'Hey Shail :-) This has some really cool tones, so I think the b&w part of your post-processing was a big hit - well done! I can''t believe how mean some people are with the comments. I agree that you went too far with the noise reduction and I would''ve made that comment had I voted on Candid. But I wish people would give criticism in a slightly less sarcastic way. Anyway, great job with the b&w, super title, nice capture. Just for fun, maybe you could try reprocessing without the NI and see how it looks. The composition is brilliant.', '2006-04-19 04:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
