(2324492, 317088, 52439, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much for the comments. <br/>It wasn''t posed at all, he didn''t even know i''d taken one, i just found it when i uploaded and really liked it, and i thought it was a good chance to try the duotone effect.<br/>I''m fairly pleased how this has done, 216th out of 393, could of been alot worse. I even managed a few 8''s, 9''s, and 10''s, so thanks to everybody who voted and commented, they really give you feedback (obviously) and help me out from other''s point''s of views. <br/>So thanks.<br/>:)</td>', 'Thank you so much for the comments. It wasn''t posed at all, he didn''t even know i''d taken one, i just found it when i uploaded and really liked it, and i thought it was a good chance to try the duotone effect.I''m fairly pleased how this has done, 216th out of 393, could of been alot worse. I even managed a few 8''s, 9''s, and 10''s, so thanks to everybody who voted and commented, they really give you feedback (obviously) and help me out from other''s point''s of views. So thanks.:)', '2006-04-19 05:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
