(2325653, 319215, 22872, '<td valign="top">Shame on all of these people that voted it on low on what ''their interpretation'' of it was....and it was clearly wrong!  I didn''t vote but did look through the photos and wondered if it was KKK or something that I wasn''t aware of...and it was something I wasn''t aware of.  <br/> <br/>I hate it when people ''assume'' they know what the photo is and vote low...and then are wrong!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Shame on all of these people that voted it on low on what ''their interpretation'' of it was....and it was clearly wrong!  I didn''t vote but did look through the photos and wondered if it was KKK or something that I wasn''t aware of...and it was something I wasn''t aware of.   I hate it when people ''assume'' they know what the photo is and vote low...and then are wrong! ', '2006-04-19 12:20:13.000000', NULL, 0),
