(2325676, 319295, 21216, '<td valign="top">Sleezy turkish bar ey? I''ll see you when you come here... You''ll have to be careful what you''re gonna eat with me! <br/> <br/>You''re probably right but still, you struck a cord :P <br/> <br/>Sleezy... ah! And you think your german bars are better! (This would sound so cool with a heavy russian accent :P)<br/> <br/>On another note, I love the pic. Very nice B&amp;W</td>', 'Sleezy turkish bar ey? I''ll see you when you come here... You''ll have to be careful what you''re gonna eat with me!  You''re probably right but still, you struck a cord :P  Sleezy... ah! And you think your german bars are better! (This would sound so cool with a heavy russian accent :P) On another note, I love the pic. Very nice B&W', '2006-04-19 12:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2325679, 318058, 52074, '<td valign="top">what an awsome candid!!!!!  Love it!! Well deserving of the 10 that it got!! Congrats!!</td>', 'what an awsome candid!!!!!  Love it!! Well deserving of the 10 that it got!! Congrats!!', '2006-04-19 12:31:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2325700, 319316, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a little doll! I''m so glad you added your definition of a candid to the author''s notes, Sandy. It''s a good reminder that it''s not always possible to see whether an image meets the challenge definition. Sherpet posted other great examples from your portfolio of your candids... they''re all telling a story, in my opinion. Nice job!</td>', 'What a little doll! I''m so glad you added your definition of a candid to the author''s notes, Sandy. It''s a good reminder that it''s not always possible to see whether an image meets the challenge definition. Sherpet posted other great examples from your portfolio of your candids... they''re all telling a story, in my opinion. Nice job!', '2006-04-19 12:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2325703, 319215, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - I was waaaaay off base.  Living in  southern America, that was the first thing that came to mind. So glad I was wrong~ I still gave it an 8 whether I believed the politics I perceived to be true, were actual or not. Powerful image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-19 11:44:10.</i></td>', 'Wow - I was waaaaay off base.  Living in  southern America, that was the first thing that came to mind. So glad I was wrong~ I still gave it an 8 whether I believed the politics I perceived to be true, were actual or not. Powerful image.', '2006-04-19 12:43:19.000000', '2006-04-19 12:44:10.000000', 0),
