(2325840, 318140, 44486, '<td valign="top">well, i must thank Mel34 for her help and advice in how to make the shot better, its mcuh appreciated and i will take this into account next time i make a shot like this so thanks :)<br/> <br/>now for my complaining, i cant belive the other two of ytou are sit their and complain! i mean yeah i dnt mind u saying that you dont like it but why and how i can make it beeter would actually help me instead of jst being very negative as it doesnt help me wat so eva. and does it make you feel better? i think not! i would expect more from people like you who call yourselve photogrpahers. im jst starting out and am very young but if all you can do is be negative and offer no advice then i dnt really want it! normally id take this in gd gracfe but im fed up with people saying things are bad and offering no advice. learn from Mel and actually offer advice!<br/>and for your information photojennic IT WAS NOT STAGED and what about it makes it look staged. im happy wiht my result and seeing as its only the seconed phot i entered and have had no photogrpahy eperioance or teaching and am jst trying to get into this field you offer a very negative start for me especially if your who im going to become.</td>', 'well, i must thank Mel34 for her help and advice in how to make the shot better, its mcuh appreciated and i will take this into account next time i make a shot like this so thanks :) now for my complaining, i cant belive the other two of ytou are sit their and complain! i mean yeah i dnt mind u saying that you dont like it but why and how i can make it beeter would actually help me instead of jst being very negative as it doesnt help me wat so eva. and does it make you feel better? i think not! i would expect more from people like you who call yourselve photogrpahers. im jst starting out and am very young but if all you can do is be negative and offer no advice then i dnt really want it! normally id take this in gd gracfe but im fed up with people saying things are bad and offering no advice. learn from Mel and actually offer advice!and for your information photojennic IT WAS NOT STAGED and what about it makes it look staged. im happy wiht my result and seeing as its only the seconed phot i entered and have had no photogrpahy eperioance or teaching and am jst trying to get into this field you offer a very negative start for me especially if your who im going to become.', '2006-04-19 13:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
