(2326203, 319964, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very sweet moment caputured here.  I agree with you that it''s cropped just a wee bit close, but just a wee bit.  I do like the composition even though his ear is very nearly centered and that probably violates all sorts of "good photo" guidelines - works for this shot very nicely!</td>', 'A very sweet moment caputured here.  I agree with you that it''s cropped just a wee bit close, but just a wee bit.  I do like the composition even though his ear is very nearly centered and that probably violates all sorts of "good photo" guidelines - works for this shot very nicely!', '2006-04-19 15:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326315, 319581, 54602, '<td valign="top">Truly amazing. I don''t know which I''m more in awe of, the story or the photo. Well done!</td>', 'Truly amazing. I don''t know which I''m more in awe of, the story or the photo. Well done!', '2006-04-19 15:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326342, 319215, 40952, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by espy:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are <br/>near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry <br/>in this challenge.<br/> <br/>A very good high key image, but to me, not a candid. In photographing candids, I prefer to see something a bit more out of the ordinary, a comic situation, a story untold, etc. I can''t get emotion from this photo. All I see is white and what I can see of the eyes is masked. Also, for me; masks, glasses, and hats are a nightmare for the candid photographer.  Unfortunately, this would have faired well in a high key challenge, but not as a candid to me.  It''s a 2. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To each his own....but a 2  ??????????<br/>I think for most to vote a 2, the image would have to be really bad and this certainly is not in that category. How can we expect anyone to enter a challenge when they''re given a 2 on a photo of that quality? I''ll probably get ripped for criticizing how someone voted. If so, thats ok.</td>', 'Originally posted by espy: I''m not much for receiving or giving comments, but since Candids are near and dear to my heart, I have decided to give comment on every entry in this challenge. A very good high key image, but to me, not a candid. In photographing candids, I prefer to see something a bit more out of the ordinary, a comic situation, a story untold, etc. I can''t get emotion from this photo. All I see is white and what I can see of the eyes is masked. Also, for me; masks, glasses, and hats are a nightmare for the candid photographer.  Unfortunately, this would have faired well in a high key challenge, but not as a candid to me.  It''s a 2.   To each his own....but a 2  ??????????I think for most to vote a 2, the image would have to be really bad and this certainly is not in that category. How can we expect anyone to enter a challenge when they''re given a 2 on a photo of that quality? I''ll probably get ripped for criticizing how someone voted. If so, thats ok.', '2006-04-19 16:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326356, 319926, 24454, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out why this one scored 4.8!  This is so cute.  So candid.  Tells such a story.  I think you did great Jacque!!!!</td>', 'I can''t figure out why this one scored 4.8!  This is so cute.  So candid.  Tells such a story.  I think you did great Jacque!!!!', '2006-04-19 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326414, 317873, 53814, '<td valign="top">My favorite of this challenge - the oversharpening gives this a unique "cut-out" look. Great composition and depth. Very creative.</td>', 'My favorite of this challenge - the oversharpening gives this a unique "cut-out" look. Great composition and depth. Very creative.', '2006-04-19 16:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326541, 318000, 44996, '<td valign="top">This was completely candid. My friend was looking at our tour guide. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments. I do suppose that part of having a good candid includes having it look candid.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-19 15:46:15.</i></td>', 'This was completely candid. My friend was looking at our tour guide.  Thanks for the comments. I do suppose that part of having a good candid includes having it look candid.', '2006-04-19 16:46:03.000000', '2006-04-19 16:46:15.000000', 0),
