(2326825, 317660, 7322, '<td valign="top">This got a 9 from me because you captured, quite naturally, their exhuberance of the dance. I love the expression on the girl to the right. It''s too bad the front girl''s feet got cropped, but for me, with this type of shot that''s not really such a big deal. I disagree immensely with epsy''s persistance (in this and other comments that she has made) that it is ''easy'' to grab really great candids of children. Feh!<br/> <br/>[i]edited to correct incorrect gender pronoun. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-21 13:31:59.</i></td>', 'This got a 9 from me because you captured, quite naturally, their exhuberance of the dance. I love the expression on the girl to the right. It''s too bad the front girl''s feet got cropped, but for me, with this type of shot that''s not really such a big deal. I disagree immensely with epsy''s persistance (in this and other comments that she has made) that it is ''easy'' to grab really great candids of children. Feh! [i]edited to correct incorrect gender pronoun. ', '2006-04-19 17:52:36.000000', '2006-04-21 14:31:59.000000', 0),
(2326828, 319295, 7322, '<td valign="top">Why oh why did this rank so low in a CANDID challenge.You''re right--it''s not DPC material but this <i>is</i> a candid challenge, right? Loved the content, loved the motion blur, especially loved the expression and overall look of the guy with the cigarette. It got an 8 from me. Now I wish I scored it higher.</td>', 'Why oh why did this rank so low in a CANDID challenge.You''re right--it''s not DPC material but this is a candid challenge, right? Loved the content, loved the motion blur, especially loved the expression and overall look of the guy with the cigarette. It got an 8 from me. Now I wish I scored it higher.', '2006-04-19 17:55:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326867, 318904, 53701, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, my feelings are hurt. No no they really arent i lied. But you people are so harsh on me. LOL. I didnt really notice how unfocused this picture was. But oh well.</td>', 'Oh boy, my feelings are hurt. No no they really arent i lied. But you people are so harsh on me. LOL. I didnt really notice how unfocused this picture was. But oh well.', '2006-04-19 18:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326874, 319808, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7. I like the wide angle view, the way their arms are unconsciously mimicking each other''s positions says a lot about their familiarity and how long this couple has been together. I like their glasses and the bit of remote peaking out from behind Dad. It is a cozy scene and conjures up warm and affectionate feelings toward this couple in a way that is not easy to evoke for the unbiased viewer. I wish I had scored higher but their were so many in this challenge and I never got a chance to vote on them all, let alone go back and revise the way I like to.<br/> I disagree wholeheartedly with espy that it was easy to capture. If you had come along earlier, their arms might not have been in the same position, or they might not have had their heads positioned conveniently to include both of their sleeping expressions.</td>', 'I gave this a 7. I like the wide angle view, the way their arms are unconsciously mimicking each other''s positions says a lot about their familiarity and how long this couple has been together. I like their glasses and the bit of remote peaking out from behind Dad. It is a cozy scene and conjures up warm and affectionate feelings toward this couple in a way that is not easy to evoke for the unbiased viewer. I wish I had scored higher but their were so many in this challenge and I never got a chance to vote on them all, let alone go back and revise the way I like to. I disagree wholeheartedly with espy that it was easy to capture. If you had come along earlier, their arms might not have been in the same position, or they might not have had their heads positioned conveniently to include both of their sleeping expressions.', '2006-04-19 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326883, 319923, 7322, '<td valign="top">Loved the expression of pure exhuberance you captured on the boy''s face. No faking that. And contrary to what espy says this sort of capture is not all that easy. <br/> <br/>I wasn''t crazy about the vertical crop and I felt the b&amp;w tone could have been tweaked a bit. Still, I gave this a 7.</td>', 'Loved the expression of pure exhuberance you captured on the boy''s face. No faking that. And contrary to what espy says this sort of capture is not all that easy.  I wasn''t crazy about the vertical crop and I felt the b&w tone could have been tweaked a bit. Still, I gave this a 7.', '2006-04-19 18:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326884, 318501, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!!  What an amazing photo on so many levels!  The photo itself is perfect in every way: lighting, focus, depth of field, color richness (Wow!!!!).   But you almost get an instant involuntary lump in your throat when you see that pretty little face and smile obviously suffering the ravages of chemo or something!<br/> <br/>A one in a million shot!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmy!!  What an amazing photo on so many levels!  The photo itself is perfect in every way: lighting, focus, depth of field, color richness (Wow!!!!).   But you almost get an instant involuntary lump in your throat when you see that pretty little face and smile obviously suffering the ravages of chemo or something! A one in a million shot! ', '2006-04-19 18:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326937, 319760, 32767, '<td valign="top">One of my few faves in the whole Challenge. Congrats!<br/> <br/>BTW Thanks for the comment....spot on.</td>', 'One of my few faves in the whole Challenge. Congrats! BTW Thanks for the comment....spot on.', '2006-04-19 18:45:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326941, 318698, 32767, '<td valign="top">This did well...glad to see but should have done better. Great mood.</td>', 'This did well...glad to see but should have done better. Great mood.', '2006-04-19 18:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
