(2327113, 319927, 33361, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jutilda:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like how she is grainy and the cars behind her are clear.  Kind of says something about her situation huh?? 7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>YES! This is exactly what I was trying to convey..some got it and others didn''t <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-19 21:04:32.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Jutilda: I really like how she is grainy and the cars behind her are clear.  Kind of says something about her situation huh?? 7   YES! This is exactly what I was trying to convey..some got it and others didn''t ', '2006-04-19 20:02:21.000000', '2006-04-19 22:04:32.000000', 0),
(2327115, 319215, 49007, '<td valign="top">To be honest a better title REALLY could have saved you in this case. ''Observing Spanish Faith'' or ''The Eyes of the Spanish Holy Week''. I think you did a great job of keeping the whites from being blown out. You''re right about the eyes needing a bit more exposure, but for DPC you didn''t have that liberty. I''m not sure about the composition, however. It may be a bit too tight.<br/> <br/>It sucks that this was not received better. As others have said, it''s a good capture independent of the perceived politics.</td>', 'To be honest a better title REALLY could have saved you in this case. ''Observing Spanish Faith'' or ''The Eyes of the Spanish Holy Week''. I think you did a great job of keeping the whites from being blown out. You''re right about the eyes needing a bit more exposure, but for DPC you didn''t have that liberty. I''m not sure about the composition, however. It may be a bit too tight. It sucks that this was not received better. As others have said, it''s a good capture independent of the perceived politics.', '2006-04-19 20:07:57.000000', NULL, 0),
