(2327455, 319760, 49667, '<td valign="top">I keep seeing this shot on my main page, and I get to where I can''t stop looking at it.  I wish I voted in this challenge because it is truly one of the best images I have seen on here.  It reminds me of Norman Rockwell''s work; there is a story to the image, and completely embedded in the single image.  Great job.</td>', 'I keep seeing this shot on my main page, and I get to where I can''t stop looking at it.  I wish I voted in this challenge because it is truly one of the best images I have seen on here.  It reminds me of Norman Rockwell''s work; there is a story to the image, and completely embedded in the single image.  Great job.', '2006-04-19 21:55:28.000000', NULL, 0),
