(2328869, 319760, 14603, '<td valign="top">What are you doing north of Watford :)?<br/> <br/>This has so much to observe, most of which you have very eloquently outlined in your "writeup".<br/>I particularly like the people in shadow perusing the butcher`s wares, adds that bit extra to the image but crucially, it doesn`t detract from the main subjects....a bit like a "Hitchcock" cameo role.<br/>Superb work as usual.<br/> <br/>Definitely a favourite.</td>', 'What are you doing north of Watford :)? This has so much to observe, most of which you have very eloquently outlined in your "writeup".I particularly like the people in shadow perusing the butcher`s wares, adds that bit extra to the image but crucially, it doesn`t detract from the main subjects....a bit like a "Hitchcock" cameo role.Superb work as usual. Definitely a favourite.', '2006-04-20 09:43:47.000000', NULL, 0),
