(2338467, 319622, 43434, '<td valign="top"><b><i>::: Critique Club :::</i></b> <br/> <br/>Hi, my name is Kari and from the critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression - the most important one:</b> <br/>It seems they breed them cute in australia ... I thought we had dibs on that here :)<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Great ... this is a lovely picture .. with a what I think is a great composition ... <br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Really meets the challenge perfectly.<br/> <br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>Lovely lighting and wonderful colours .. you have maximised the best from this shot.<br/> <br/><b>To grow its vote?:</b> <br/>I really am not sure .. .all the top shots are totally unique shots with there pluses and minusus as is yours.<br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>This is wonderful .. you have a great portfolio .. keep it up .. I am impressed ... are you sure you are an aussie :)<br/> <br/>If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via the PM system.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', '::: Critique Club :::  Hi, my name is Kari and from the critique club. First Impression - the most important one: It seems they breed them cute in australia ... I thought we had dibs on that here :) Composition: Great ... this is a lovely picture .. with a what I think is a great composition ...  Subject: Really meets the challenge perfectly. Technical (Colour and light): Lovely lighting and wonderful colours .. you have maximised the best from this shot. To grow its vote?: I really am not sure .. .all the top shots are totally unique shots with there pluses and minusus as is yours. Summary: This is wonderful .. you have a great portfolio .. keep it up .. I am impressed ... are you sure you are an aussie :) If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via the PM system. Cheers Kari', '2006-04-24 06:46:31.000000', NULL, 0),
