(2346539, 319926, 28742, '<td valign="top">Missed this in the voting, but would''ve given it an easy 6. Has some technical problems, but perfect for the challenge and just an overall great candid.</td>', 'Missed this in the voting, but would''ve given it an easy 6. Has some technical problems, but perfect for the challenge and just an overall great candid.', '2006-04-26 14:01:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2348295, 319926, 46468, '<td valign="top">Really love this one, you can see the boy is not happy with the bird, great candid. A little overexposed on the white sand, not easy to shoot a sandy beach in Florida.</td>', 'Really love this one, you can see the boy is not happy with the bird, great candid. A little overexposed on the white sand, not easy to shoot a sandy beach in Florida.', '2006-04-26 21:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2353154, 318501, 2490, '<td valign="top">She''s a beautiful girl, and this is an excellent shot of a priceless moment.  I don''t "pity" these children, but my heart goes out to them.  The only unfortunate thing in your shot is that the background is similar to the skintone.  A little more "contrast" there would have made it a very punchy shot.  I understand that was out of your control, but it''s just a wish, you know? :)</td>', 'She''s a beautiful girl, and this is an excellent shot of a priceless moment.  I don''t "pity" these children, but my heart goes out to them.  The only unfortunate thing in your shot is that the background is similar to the skintone.  A little more "contrast" there would have made it a very punchy shot.  I understand that was out of your control, but it''s just a wish, you know? :)', '2006-04-28 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2353600, 320003, 23053, '<td valign="top">Mr. Funk, I have to say that I, like pretty much all others, appreciate all of the time you take to comment on other''s images.  I for one, however, would like to see you make the same effort on your images.  I feel that there is more to gain from the little narative in the ''Comments'' section of the photo than from the technical information.  Very rarely do I find it interesting that a shot was taken at 1/500 sec and iso 200, but to find out that this is the photog''s favorite spot to take shots, or it''s one of a series of self portraits, or was accidentally taken when they sat on the remote...its a brief look into the photog''s psyche...a cool trip.</td>', 'Mr. Funk, I have to say that I, like pretty much all others, appreciate all of the time you take to comment on other''s images.  I for one, however, would like to see you make the same effort on your images.  I feel that there is more to gain from the little narative in the ''Comments'' section of the photo than from the technical information.  Very rarely do I find it interesting that a shot was taken at 1/500 sec and iso 200, but to find out that this is the photog''s favorite spot to take shots, or it''s one of a series of self portraits, or was accidentally taken when they sat on the remote...its a brief look into the photog''s psyche...a cool trip.', '2006-04-28 15:08:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2353761, 318848, 42984, '<td valign="top">Bear_music, is that you?</td>', 'Bear_music, is that you?', '2006-04-28 16:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
