(2537362, 319336, 37893, '<td valign="top">I agree with the comments below. This is in fact one of those rare moments captured. Perfect timing here. There is a slight blue cast in the BW image. I''m not sure why I''m seeing it but the tonal qualities could be improved with a boost in channels and levels. Good shot nontheless.</td>', 'I agree with the comments below. This is in fact one of those rare moments captured. Perfect timing here. There is a slight blue cast in the BW image. I''m not sure why I''m seeing it but the tonal qualities could be improved with a boost in channels and levels. Good shot nontheless.', '2006-06-21 17:01:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540525, 317088, 56797, '<td valign="top">I love this one. wish I could be more critical but its great. :)</td>', 'I love this one. wish I could be more critical but its great. :)', '2006-06-22 10:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540588, 317088, 27605, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this shot but there are a few things I note that detract from it for me.  The vertical bar on the left of the photo really draws my eye away from the subject, especially considering how bright it is.  The crop, too, so tall and narrow.  I think I understand that you were emphasizing the lankiness of the fellow by doing so, but it makes me hesitate... not sure about it.  <br/> <br/>I do like the composition, however.  Others commented that he is just hanging there but to me it communicates exhaustion and fatigue.  The exposure is good but the b/w conversion is a bit bland in my opinion.  Overall a nice first entry... it scored much better than my first! :o)</td>', 'Overall I like this shot but there are a few things I note that detract from it for me.  The vertical bar on the left of the photo really draws my eye away from the subject, especially considering how bright it is.  The crop, too, so tall and narrow.  I think I understand that you were emphasizing the lankiness of the fellow by doing so, but it makes me hesitate... not sure about it.   I do like the composition, however.  Others commented that he is just hanging there but to me it communicates exhaustion and fatigue.  The exposure is good but the b/w conversion is a bit bland in my opinion.  Overall a nice first entry... it scored much better than my first! :o)', '2006-06-22 10:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2552594, 319608, 1280, '<td valign="top">John,  I like the emotion in the singer''s face, and the tones you''ve captured.  B&amp;W suit it well too.  Unfortunately her arm draws the eye away from her face because it is a large, light mass.  Naturally light draws the eye. <br/>I like how she holds her pinky up when holding a mic...like me...tehehe. The only improvement would be to crop most of her arm out. Otherwise very nice! :)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.graycedillon.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Grayce</a></td>', 'John,  I like the emotion in the singer''s face, and the tones you''ve captured.  B&W suit it well too.  Unfortunately her arm draws the eye away from her face because it is a large, light mass.  Naturally light draws the eye. I like how she holds her pinky up when holding a mic...like me...tehehe. The only improvement would be to crop most of her arm out. Otherwise very nice! :) Grayce', '2006-06-25 20:54:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2585521, 319951, 28114, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.Love his freckles,and how,with the shot close up,you focus on his eyes,nose and mouth. Great work.Eyes closed works fine,we dont always smile with eyes open.</td>', 'I love this shot.Love his freckles,and how,with the shot close up,you focus on his eyes,nose and mouth. Great work.Eyes closed works fine,we dont always smile with eyes open.', '2006-07-04 23:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
